times.com/2015/01/01/1940-paris-celebrates-new-year/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: 1940: Paris Celebrates New Year in spite of the War.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paris forgot the war and its black-out and the other entire minor inconveniences of a nation in arms Sunday night to enjoy ‘‘the best New Year’s Eve in twenty years,’’ as one old timer described the evening’s festivities. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1940: Paris Celebrates New Year', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-01T14:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e4a19e1-4019-565c-9123-c5b6901973ac', 'word_count': 79, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e4a19e1-4019-565c-9123-c5b6901973ac'}, {'abstract': 'Patricia Arquette says being a single mother as a young actress motivated her to “drag meat back for my young,” developing a steeliness that helped her career.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/movies/patricia-arquette-born-for-boyhood.html', 'snippet': 'Patricia Arquette says being a single mother as a young actress motivated her to “drag meat back for my young,” developing a steeliness that helped her career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — When Patricia Arquette 