.com/2015/01/02/theater/an-all-gyllenhaal-weekend-anyone.html', 'snippet': 'It’s not often that the stars align this way. But the cosmic event here concerns the sibling actors Gyllenhaal, Maggie and Jake.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not often that the stars align this way. But the cosmic event here concerns the sibling actors Gyllenhaal, Maggie and Jake. She stars in a play on Broadway that will close on Sunday (Tom Stoppard’s “The Real Thing,” second from right). He stars in a play on Broadway now in previews that will open in a little more than a week (Nick Payne’s “Constellations,” far right). And they are both getting awards-season attention for their current screen work. She has been nominated for a Golden Globe for her performance in the summer TV mini-series “The Honorable Woman” (far left), which you can view now on Sundance.tv. And he is suddenly being mentioned everywhere for his creepy role in the film “Nightcrawler” (second from left), still in theaters. Binge away.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/arts/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 216, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/02/arts/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 216}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/arts/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/arts/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO/02GYLLENHAAL_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'r