lls on Wednesday, but no interview has been scheduled yet, said a person with knowledge of the team’s thinking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/02/sports/football/doug-marrone-is-among-jets-candidates.html', 'snippet': 'The team plans to speak next week with Marrone, who opted out as coach of the Buffalo Bills on Wednesday, but no interview has been scheduled yet, said a person with knowledge of the team’s thinking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Make Doug Marrone the Jets’ seventh confirmed coaching candidate. The team plans to speak next week with Marrone, who opted out as coach of the Buffalo Bills on Wednesday, but no interview has been scheduled yet, said a person with knowledge of the team’s thinking. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Doug Marrone Is Among Jets’ Candidates', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Pro Football', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Marrone, Ex-Bills Coach, Is Among Seven Candidates for Jets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marrone, Doug', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Buffalo Bills', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lynn, Anthony (1968- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-02T04:50:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/14d7ea24-43ef-5b0f-b7f1-4a1db04a9aa0', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14d7ea24-43ef-5b0f-b7f1-4a1db04a9aa0'}, {'abstract': 'After years of waiting for the left-hander Manny Banuelos to fulfill his potential, the Yankees traded him to Atlanta for the right-handed pitcher David Carpenter and the left-hander Chasen Shreve.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/02/sports/baseball/yankees-trade-former-top-prospect-to-braves.html', 'snippet': 'After years of waiting for the left-hander Manny Banuelos to fulfill his potential, the Yankees traded him to Atlanta for the right-handed pitcher David Carpenter and the left-hander Chasen Shreve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After years of waiting for the left-hander Manny Banuelos to fulfill his potential, the Yankees gave up on him, trading him to the Atlanta Braves for the right-handed pitcher David Carpenter and the left-hander Chasen Shreve. Banuelos joined the Yankees organization in 2008 but never reached the major leagues despite his promising ability. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Trade Former Top Prospect to Braves', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees Trade a Former Top Prospect to the Braves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Banuelos, Manny', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Braves', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carpenter, David (1985- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shreve, Chasen (1990- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trades (Sports)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-02T04:51:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'sub