nd Rises.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The nominations won’t be announced until Jan. 15, but it’s safe to say that the greatest filmmaker associated with the 2015 Academy Awards has already received his Oscar, delivered a modest but revealing acceptance speech and flown home to Japan and, perhaps, retirement.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 679}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 906, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1851, 'width': 1636, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04HALE4/04HALE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Master of Childhood Dreams ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Master of Childhood Dreams', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miyazaki, Hayao', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMATED FILMS', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Wind Rises (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-02T14:39:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'subsection_name': 'Awards Season', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57e24312-6552-5727-be8c-3ec635adcc48', 'word_count': 1103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57e24312-6552-5727-be8c-3ec635adcc48'}, {'abstract': 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu made some unorthodox choices as director and a writer of “Birdman.” They appear to have paid off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/movies/awardsseason/alejandro-g-inarritu-turns-birdman-into-risk-central.html', 'snippet': 'Alejandro G. Iñárritu made some unorthodox choices as director and a writer of “Birdman.” They appear to have paid off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Audiences could get vertigo following the meta-narrative of “Birdman,” Alejandro G. Iñárritu’s film about a washed-up action star, Riggan Thomson (Michael Keaton), trying to regain a little prestige by doing a Broadway play — contending with showboating actors playing showboating actors — and losing track of reality in the process. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/arts/04RYZIK1/04RYZIK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subTyp