 'uri': 'nyt://article/283f0bbf-4a10-5332-99fe-23cfd4ecb5a7'}, {'abstract': 'The two officers, who were in charge of patrolling the girl’s village, were suspended and are now missing, according a police official.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/03/world/asia/indian-officials-seek-2-police-officers-accused-of-raping-girl-14.html', 'snippet': 'The two officers, who were in charge of patrolling the girl’s village, were suspended and are now missing, according a police official.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — The Indian police said on Friday that they were searching for two officers in the Budaun district of Uttar Pradesh after a 14-year-old girl from a local village accused them of raping her.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indian Officials Seek 2 Police Officers Accused of Raping Girl, 14', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'India: Policemen Accused of Rape', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kumar, Hari', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uttar Pradesh State (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-02T15:13:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hari Kumar and Nida Najar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Najar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materi