 able to represent these people, a lot of times, we haven’t had the space to give them a proper presentation.” Now, the roll call that includes such fine-jewelry designers as Lydia Courteille, Abraxas Rex, Stephen Webster, Garrard and many others will have room to shine in Alchemist’s spacious new third outpost, opening in the Palm Court complex in the city’s Design District.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/t-magazine/02alchemist-moss-1/02alchemist-moss-1-thumbLa