rison recalls a teenage trip to the Sand Hills, which foretold the novels he would write years later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/travel/a-prairie-prologue-in-nebraska-.html', 'snippet': 'The author Jim Harrison recalls a teenage trip to the Sand Hills, which foretold the novels he would write years later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1954, as an impetuous, irascible 16-year-old, I got my first view quite by accident of Nebraska’s Sand Hills. In my sophomore year of high school it had occurred to me that the lakes and forests of Michigan were too small for my burgeoning personality. I was an athlete of sorts, a student leader, but also an addict of Faulkner and James Joyce. Throw in Rimbaud and Dostoyevsky and I was an absurdly premature powder keg and felt I should look in a far field.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/travel/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-Front/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 507, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/04/travel/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-Front/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 507}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/travel/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-Front/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 832, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/travel/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-Front/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 832, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/travel/04SANDHILLS_COMBO-Front/04SANDHILLS_COM