avant,” an eight-episode comic series, features devious damsels and men in armor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/03/arts/television/galavant-musical-on-abc-has-some-naughty-laughs.html', 'snippet': '“Galavant,” an eight-episode comic series, features devious damsels and men in armor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Television sure is eager to appropriate the stage musical form lately, and ABC makes a saucy, silly attempt on Sunday with “Galavant,” an eight-episode comic series featuring men in armor and devious damsels. Despite some amusing bits and clever songs, it’s only occasionally as much fun as it ought to be.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/arts/galavant/galavant-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/03/arts/galavant/galavant-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/arts/galavant/galavant-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/arts/galavant/galavant-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1473, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/arts/galavant/galavant-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/03/arts/galavant/galavant-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':