 keepsake from her time performing in the Amazon: a handcrafted poison-dart gun. (It does not work.) She lives on the Upper West Side with a view of the Hudson River and of a statue of her heroine, Eleanor Roosevelt. Ms. Isbin, a 58-year-old classical guitarist, has been a trailblazer both for female musicians and for the guitar’s place in the classical music world. She is the director of guitar programs at the Juilliard School and at the Aspen Music Festival, and will tour again this spring. A documentary on public television, “Sharon Isbin: Troubadour,” explores her musical beginnings in Italy, her teenage years in Minnesota and her lifelong collaborations with composers.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sharon Isbin: Seeking Out Serenity', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seeking Out Serenity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robbins, Liz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Guitars', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper West Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Isbin, Sharon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-02T20:57:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Robbins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robbins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46b70b1f-6d8c-542b-bd8d-2801ea321164', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46b70b1f-6d8c-542b-bd8d-2801ea321164'}, {'abstract': 'Gerrard, Liverpool’s longtime captain, ruled out joining any club that might see him line up against the Reds.', 'web_url