rtising on social media, an old debt, and an old area code.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/style/social-qs-paying-for-peace.html', 'snippet': 'Questions about a money issue between siblings, false advertising on social media, an old debt, and an old area code.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our daughter and son-in-law, a certified 1 percenter, moved to suburbia with their children. They need a second car because he won’t take the train to work. Our son lent them his pristine vintage Mercedes, and our daughter got into an accident with it, causing $6,000 of damage. So far, our son-in-law has balked at all estimates for repair and told my son to submit an insurance claim. But our son doesn’t want to because his premiums may increase. Harsh words were spoken. Who is right?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', '