ouch to an Officer’s Funeral', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Calligrapher Brings an Elegant Touch to a Chinese Ceremony', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, Wenjian (1982-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Singer, Jeffrey E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zhao Ru', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chinese-Americans', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bensonhurst (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-03T01:46:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey E. Singer and Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3dc2d8bf-d169-578d-b11f-3f0d41643ceb', 'word_count': 834, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3dc2d8bf-d169-578d-b11f-3f0d41643ceb'}, {'abstract': 'The Catholic Church in Boston sold property in its headquarters to pay settlements to sexual abuse victims, a 10-year process that has altered familiar symbols in “Little Rome.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/03/us/seat-of-bostons-catholic-power-gives-way-to-other-pursuits.html', 'snippet': 'The Catholic Church in Boston sold property in its headquarters to pay settlements to sexual abuse victims, a 10-year process that has altered familiar symbols in “Little Rome.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The house on the rise has long been a symbol of Catholicism in Boston. When it was built, its grandeur demonstrated the wherewithal of the city’s newly powerful Roman Catholic community. When it was sold, the transaction reflected the straits of a once-powerful archdiocese brought low by scandal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/us/BOSTON1/BOSTON1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/03/us/BOSTON1/BOSTON1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/us/BOSTON1/BOSTON1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/us/BOSTON1/BOSTON1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/03/us/BOSTON1/BOSTON1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/03/