, '_id': 'nyt://article/fd13bd68-c820-5d57-8486-58c0e41efdd0', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd13bd68-c820-5d57-8486-58c0e41efdd0'}, {'abstract': 'Voters, battered by misguided austerity policies, are looking beyond mainstream political parties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/opinion/sunday/a-weary-greece-considers-its-options.html', 'snippet': 'Voters, battered by misguided austerity policies, are looking beyond mainstream political parties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The human toll of the economic crisis in Greece has been significant: Rates of hunger, suicide and unemployment have increased sharply, thanks to years of misguided austerity policies. So it is hardly shocking that polls are showing that voters are likely to give control of Parliament to the leftist political party Syriza in an election later this month.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/opinion/04Sun2/04Sun2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/04/opinion/04Sun2/04Sun2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/opinion/04Sun2/04Sun2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/opinion/04Sun2/04Sun2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/opinion/04Sun2/04Sun2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 't