e to the Ebola virus while in Sierra Leone was flown to a hospital in Nebraska on Sunday for observation and possible treatment, according to a hospital official.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Health Worker Exposed to Ebola in Sierra Leone Arrives in Nebraska', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Health Worker Exposed to Ebola in Sierra Leone Arrives in Nebraska', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Omaha (Neb)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Nebraska', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nebraska', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-04T06:32:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6003121-1941-5769-a2e6-21eb99131714', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6003121-1941-5769-a2e6-21eb99131714'}, {'abstract': 'Simon Norfolk, a British photographer, traveled to Africa to document the disappearance of Mount Kenya’s glaciers, plotting previous boundaries with fire in long-exposure photographs.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/fire-and-ice-mount-kenyas-lost-glaciers/', 'snippet': 'Simon Norfolk, a British photographer, traveled to Africa to document the disappearance of Mount Kenya’s glaciers, plotting previous boundaries with fire in long-exposure photographs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In October, Simon Norfolk went to Mount Kenya to document the gradually disappearing glaciers. Even though the shrinkage of the glacier that he focused on has been well surveyed since 1934, it is difficult to photograph what has already disappeared.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fire and Ice: Mount Kenya’s Lost Glaciers', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Glaciers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Norfolk, Simon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mount Kenya', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-04T10:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afff5419-a7c3-5f80-a319-727459bd19fa', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afff5419-a7c3-5f80-a319-727459bd19fa'}, {'abstract': 'The North reiterated its denial of involvement in the hacking of Sony and said that Washington’s sanctions would only strengthen its resolve to pursue its “military first” policy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/05/world/asia/north-korea-criticizes-us-over-new-sanctions.html', 'snippet': 'The North reiterated its denial of involvement in the hacking of Sony and said that Washington’s sanctions would only strengthen its resolve to pursue its “military first” policy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — North Korea denounced the United States on Sunday for imposing new sanctions on it after a cyberattack on Sony Pictures, calling them byproducts of American “hostility” toward the North.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'North Korea Denounces U.S. Over Its Latest Sanctions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'North Korea Denounces U.S. Over Its Latest Sanctions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberwarfare', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Pictures Entertainment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Interview (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Sanctions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-04T10:00:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Choe Sang-Hun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Choe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sang-Hun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b90d120f-85b6-5a7d-8fd0-9efb1a5c5f91', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b90d120f-85b6-5a7d-8fd0-9efb1a5c5f91'}, {'abstract': 'The attack targeted an Uzbek commander and killed at least six fighters on a base near the border with Afghanistan, according to a Pakistani security official.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/05/world/asia/us-drone-strike-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'The attack targeted an Uzbek commander and killed at least six fighters on a base near the border with Afghanistan, according to a Pakistani security official.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PESHAWAR, Pakistan — At least six foreign militants were believed to have been killed in an American drone strike in the North Waziristan tribal region on Sunday morning, a Pakistani security official said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], '