, buy a T-shirt. Artists are rewarded at the end of the process, not in the beginning the way they used to be.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1409, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/02/technology/bits-leveque/bits-leveque-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Indie Writers of Amazon, It’s Publish or Perish', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the Indie Writers of Amazon, Itu2019s Publish or Perish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Amazon Kindle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Books and Readers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swift, Taylor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-04T12:08:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Streitfeld', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Streitfeld', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/93a9f39b-3d09-56e9-89e3-919b78017cca', 'word_count': 1114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93a9f39b-3d09-56e9-89e3-919b78017cca'}, {'abstract': 'I worried that my daughter’s decision to take a gap year would mean she’d never go to college. I shouldn’t have.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/04/in-fervent-support-of-the-gap-year-2/', 'snippet': 'I worried that my daughter’s decision to take a gap year would mean she’d never go to college. I shouldn’t have.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I wasn’t enthusiastic when my daughter first floated her plan to take a “gap year” before college. As someone who couldn’t wait to matriculate, I didn’t see the point of delaying that great intellectual awakening. I felt vaguely disappointed that she wasn’t more eager to embrace all those books and ideas and late-night conversations about the cosmos. And what if her gap year turned into a permanent crevasse and she never earned a degree? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/02/10/sports/0210_SPT_village_s