York City Ballet dancers showed little fatigue and finished the run with verve.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/05/arts/dance/new-york-city-ballet-wraps-up-nutcracker-season.html', 'snippet': 'Despite performing “The Nutcracker” nearly 50 times since the day after Thanksgiving, New York City Ballet dancers showed little fatigue and finished the run with verve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Between the day after Thanksgiving and the first weekend of the new year, New York City Ballet gave nearly 50 performances of “George Balanchine’s The Nutcracker.” That’s a lot, but if the dancers were suffering from “Nutcracker” fatigue (a common seasonal condition) on Friday afternoon at the David H. Koch Theater, it didn’t show. If anything, many seemed to summon extra verve and abandon to carry them through the homestretch of the run.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/arts/NYCBCRACK/NYCBCRACK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/05/arts/NYCBCRACK/NYCBCRACK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/arts/NYCBCRACK/NYCBCRACK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/arts/NYCBCRACK/NYCBCRACK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1289, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/arts/NYCBCRACK/NYCBCRACK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu