', 'value': 'Isaac, Oscar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schultz, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Society of Film Critics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-05T13:59:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cara Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/495d6193-cc78-5d0b-8276-2cb591822bc5', 'word_count': 313, 'uri': 'nyt://article/495d6193-cc78-5d0b-8276-2cb591822bc5'}, {'abstract': 'The Californian’s forthcoming album, “On Your Own Love Again,” brings to mind everyone from Judy Collins to Joanna Newsom, but has a spirit all its own.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/05/meet-jessica-pratt-2015s-folk-singer-songwriter-to-watch/', 'snippet': 'The Californian’s forthcoming album, “On Your Own Love Again,” brings to mind everyone from Judy Collins to Joanna Newsom, but has a spirit all its own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Californian singer-songwriter Jessica Pratt tends to be classified under the term “freak-folk.” Yet on “Strange Melody,” the third track from her forthcoming second album, “On Your Own Love Again” (out Jan. 27 from Drag City), she accidentally evokes a familiar ’80s New Wave tune. “I noticed there was a similar vocal melody to Duran Duran’s ‘Hungry Like the Wolf’ right when I was recording it,” Pratt says by phone from San Francisco in the midst of a biblical downpour. “I like those strange references that happen sometimes in music, so I just left it in there.” A similar spirit of serendipity also informs the rest of the album, a collection of eloquent, lingering acoustic songs that brings to mind everyone from the chanteuse Judy Collins to Joanna Newsom.\xa0The first single, “Back, Baby,” appears below.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 1619, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/t-magazine/05pratt-beta/05pratt-beta-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Meet Jessica Pratt, 2015’s Folk Singer-Songwriter to Watch', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Folk Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'pers