onomists-.html', 'snippet': 'As the economic recovery is picking up, the talk is shifting away from concerns about unemployment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The big annual gabfest for academic economists, currently underway in Boston, provides a useful signal of how the field is evolving. Consider this a dispatch from the pleated khaki-clad trenches. The clearest theme so far is a renewed interest in inequality.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 462}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 789, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1578, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/upshot/06UP-Wolfers/06UP-Wolfers-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'mai