cle/a78bf296-66ca-5a44-8792-2b5e44932acb'}, {'abstract': 'In the production design for “The Grand Budapest Hotel,” Plan A involved helicopters in the Alps. Plan B called for replicas and stop-motion animation. Plan B won out.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/05/grand-budapest-hotel-design/', 'snippet': 'In the production design for “The Grand Budapest Hotel,” Plan A involved helicopters in the Alps. Plan B called for replicas and stop-motion animation. Plan B won out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its candy-colored dollhouse sets, miniaturized funicular and post-Weimar-era grandeur, “The Grand Budapest Hotel” offered moviegoers one of the most visually sumptuous confections of 2014. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/06/arts/stockhausen/stockhausen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/06/arts/stockhausen/stockhausen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/06/arts/stockhausen/stockhausen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/06/arts/stockhausen/stockhausen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1412, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/06/arts/stockhausen/stockhausen-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/06/arts/stockhausen/stockhausen-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe