e is “not entirely accurate.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/us/ferguson-grand-juror-sues-for-right-to-speak-about-case.html', 'snippet': 'The juror, bound to secrecy under Missouri law, says in a federal lawsuit that the public’s impression of the grand jury’s work in the Michael Brown case is “not entirely accurate.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A member of the grand jury that did not indict a white police officer in the fatal shooting of an unarmed black teenager in Ferguson, Mo., sued the county prosecutor on Monday, seeking to speak out because the public’s impression of the grand jury’s work was “not entirely accurate.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grand Juror in Ferguson Sues to End Silence Rule', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Grand Juror in Ferguson Sues to End Silence Rule', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jury System', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Darren (1986- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Civil Liberties Union', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCulloch, Robert P (1951- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-05T19:27:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mitch Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mitch', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/963879c0-889b-5dd5-afed-0c04892abf5e', 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/963879c0-889b-5dd5-afed-0c04892abf5e'}, {'abstract': 'Sugar makers have historically relied solely on the weather to predict good and bad syrup years. But research suggests that seed production is a key indicator of what is set to flow from the trees and onto your pancakes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/science/the-bloom-is-on-for-maple-syrup.html', 'snippet': 'Sugar makers have historically relied solely on the weather to predict good and bad syrup years. But research suggests that seed production is a key indicator of what is set to flow from the trees and onto your pancakes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pancake lovers, take heart. In the coming weeks, maple farmers throughout Quebec, Vermont and elsewhere in the syrup belt will dust off their metal spiles for another harvest season, and some scientists are predicting that the sugary sap will flow even more freely than usual. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bloom Is On for Maple Syrup', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Bloom Is On for Maple Syrup', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maple Syrup and Sugar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Northeastern States (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Quebec Province (Canada)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sugar', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-05T19:28:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'sec