, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d988a384-c0e3-5ba6-b74c-f70ec1697fb2', 'word_count': 921, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d988a384-c0e3-5ba6-b74c-f70ec1697fb2'}, {'abstract': 'The training is scheduled to start in March and is expected to involve 15,000 rebels as part of the American-led effort to combat ISIS, the official said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/world/europe/turkey-will-help-train-moderate-syrian-rebels-diplomat-says.html', 'snippet': 'The training is scheduled to start in March and is expected to involve 15,000 rebels as part of the American-led effort to combat ISIS, the official said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MUGLA, Turkey — Turkey is ready to conclude an agreement this month to train and equip moderate Syrian rebels as part of the American-led effort to combat Islamic State fighters, a senior Turkish diplomat said Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkey Will Help Train Moderate Syrian Rebels, Diplomat Says', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey: Help for Syrian Rebels', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arsu, Sebnem', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-05T20:55:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sebnem Arsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sebnem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arsu