nyt://article/1eda64b3-7d13-5cc4-b675-f02ce10b3d36'}, {'abstract': 'New Yorkers, both the famous and the ordinary, lined up outside the Frank E. Campbell funeral home on the Upper East Side of Manhattan to attend the former governor’s wake.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/nyregion/mourners-pay-their-respects-to-mario-cuomo.html', 'snippet': 'New Yorkers, both the famous and the ordinary, lined up outside the Frank E. Campbell funeral home on the Upper East Side of Manhattan to attend the former governor’s wake.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They waited in the bitter cold, in some cases for more than two hours, drawn to pay their respects to a gifted politician they admired. Many came from the highest ranks of New York’s political world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/nyregion/jp-cuomo/jp-cuomo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/06/nyregion/jp-cuomo/jp-cuomo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/nyregion/jp-cuomo/jp-cuomo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/nyregion/jp-cuomo/jp-cuomo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1394, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/nyregion/jp-cuomo/jp-cuomo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/06/nyregion/jp-cuom