new streaming service from Dish Network bundles 12 channels together for $20 a month.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/paying-for-the-tv-shows-you-want/', 'snippet': 'The new streaming service from Dish Network bundles 12 channels together for $20 a month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new streaming TV service from Dish Network is not going to kill the cable bundle—at least not in its current form. But the service, which Dish is calling Sling TV, should help some people save money by allowing them to pay only for the TV shows that they actually want to watch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paying for the TV Shows You Want', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dish Network', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-06T14:59:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vikas Bajaj', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vikas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bajaj', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf90efca-9f91-5941-ba9f-1ee7f0a3ff57', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf90efca-9f91-5941-ba9f-1ee7f0a3ff57'}, {'abstract': 'Rivka Galchen and Leslie Jamison discuss why we react so strongly against clichés.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/books/review/why-do-we-hate-clich.html', 'snippet': 'Rivka Galchen and Leslie Jamison discuss why we react so strongly against clichés.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each week in Bookends, two writers take on questions about the world of books. This week, Rivka Galchen and Leslie Jamison discuss why we react so strongly against clichés.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subty