32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66e5e34b-57d6-51c5-ab7f-49eaf9d60102', 'word_count': 1455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66e5e34b-57d6-51c5-ab7f-49eaf9d60102'}, {'abstract': 'Nicholas Cullinan, 37, who was born in Connecticut but grew up in England, will be the 12th director in the gallery’s 158-year history.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/national-portrait-gallery-names-new-director/', 'snippet': 'Nicholas Cullinan, 37, who was born in Connecticut but grew up in England, will be the 12th director in the gallery’s 158-year history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Nicholas Cullinan, who has been the curator of modern and contemporary art at the Metropolitan Museum of Art in New York for the last two years, has been appointed the new director of the National Portrait Gallery here, the gallery announced on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'National Portrait Gallery Names New Director', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Met Curator to Lead Museum in Britain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cullinan, Nicholas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Courtauld Institute of Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of Modern Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Portrait Gallery (London)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-06T15:10:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d6d642a-b275-532d-8558-d57c67b9631e', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d6d642a-b275-532d-8558-d57c67b9631e'}, {'abstract': 'With deployment hanging over our heads, 2015 will come with incredible challenges for our marriage, our children and ourselves. I’m resolving to take care of myself as well as my children, accept help when we need it, give it where we can and appreciate our beautiful mess.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/resolutions-for-a-year-of-change-in-a-military-family/', 'snippet': 'With deployment hanging over our heads, 2015 will come with incredible challenges for our marriage, our children and ourselves. I’m resolving to take care of myself as well as my children, accept help when we need it, give it where we can and appr...', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve never cared much for New Year’s resolutions. Mostly, I subscribe to the mentality that if you want to make a change in your life, you don’t need a specific date to do it. This year, however, I’m giving it a chance, hoping that “if I write it down,” I’ll be more inclined to commit. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/us/motherlode-tessa-10/motherlode-tessa-10-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/05/us/motherlode-tessa-10/motherlode-tessa-10-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/05/us/motherlode-tessa-10/motherlode-tessa-10-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'ju