slander,” becoming the first non-American to be nominated in the category’s 20-year history.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/jarle-bernhoft-grammy-nominee/', 'snippet': 'The Norwegian ex-rocker earned a Best R&B album nod for “Islander,” becoming the first non-American to be nominated in the category’s 20-year history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With his oversize Buddy Holly glasses, trim suits and carefully coiffed hair, 38-year-old Jarle Bernhoft certainly looks the part of fledgling R&B star. The rest of his story, however, is more unexpected. Before breaking through last year with the release of “Islander,” a silky-smooth mash-up of disco grooves and soaring falsetto melodies that gracefully picks up the neo-soul torch Robin Thicke so clumsily dropped last year, the Oslo native toiled in Norway for years as the frontman for the rock bands Explicit Lyrics and Span. After a string of successes with the latter — “It wasn’t massive, but we were pretty big in Norway,” he says — the singer was left to rethink his path after the band dissolved in 2005.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/t-magazine/06bernheim-oloizia/06bernheim-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/06/t-magazine/06bernheim-oloizia/06bernheim-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/t-magazine/06bernheim-oloizia/06bernheim-oloizia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/06/t-magazine/06bernheim-oloizia/06bernheim-oloizia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'wid