s to be more like Shake Shack, which has filed for an I.P.O., but the burger chains are not the same and serve different types of customers.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/06/why-mcdonalds-isnt-shake-shack-and-probably-shouldnt-be/', 'snippet': 'Wall Street wants McDonald’s to be more like Shake Shack, which has filed for an I.P.O., but the burger chains are not the same and serve different types of customers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wall Street wants McDonald’s to be more like Shake Shack, the hamburger purveyor in New York that just filed for an initial public offering that could value it at a billion dollars. But perhaps instead, Wall Street should let McDonald’s be McDonald’s and be careful about whether Shake Shack is a burger bubble.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/business/07DEALPROF2/07DEALPROF2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/07/business/07DEALPROF2/07DEALPROF2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/business/07DEALPROF2/07DEALPROF2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/business/07DEALPROF2/07DEALPROF2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 816, 'width': 1223, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/business/07DEALPROF2/07DEALPROF2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'