o reach their children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/07/nyregion/ban-on-cellphones-in-new-york-city-schools-to-be-lifted.html', 'snippet': 'The policy, which has been inconsistently enforced, has been unpopular among parents, who worry about not being able to reach their children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City’s Department of Education plans to announce on Wednesday that it will lift the ban on cellphones in schools, a person familiar with the decision said Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ban on Cellphones in New York City Schools to Be Lifted', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Schools Plan to Lift Ban and Permit Cellphones', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-07T02:24:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0338393-d4a8-5a95-8475-4d48c8670e39', 'word_count': 450, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0338393-d4a8-5a95-8475-4d48c8670e39'}, {'abstract': 'The California governor attended a decidedly ceremonial groundbreaking for his high-speed train, a defiant and defining act for Mr. Brown as he enters his final term.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/07/us/to-brown-a-legacy-to-others-a-runaway-train.html', 'snippet': 'The California governor attended a decidedly ceremonial groundbreaking for his high-speed train, a defiant and defining act for Mr. Brown as he enters his final term.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRESNO, Calif. — One day after being sworn in to a final term as governor, Jerry Brown, a chief executive who tends to disdain the trappings of political ceremony, came to this Central Valley city on Tuesday for a decidedly ceremonial groundbreaking for his Los Angeles-to-San Francisco high-speed train — a defiant and defining act for Mr. Brown as he enters his final stretch in public life.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/TRAIN/TRAIN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cr