cle/6a496741-a861-5ccb-ac4d-7a9f562d8b00', 'word_count': 1807, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a496741-a861-5ccb-ac4d-7a9f562d8b00'}, {'abstract': 'The new Congress members arrived eager and optimistic, even though some had not found places to live and were having challenges finding where they needed to go in the Capitol.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/07/us/politics/as-power-in-congress-shifts-to-gop-lives-of-freshmen-in-transition.html', 'snippet': 'The new Congress members arrived eager and optimistic, even though some had not found places to live and were having challenges finding where they needed to go in the Capitol.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Three hours after he was sworn in as a new member of Congress on Tuesday, Representative Ted Lieu, Democrat of California, stood outside the House chamber looking bewildered as a colleague breezed past him, asking, “Where’s Nancy’s thing?” — a reference to the opening day open house of Nancy Pelosi, the Democratic leader.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Power in Congress Shifts to G.O.P., Lives of Freshmen in Transition', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Power in Congress Shifts to G.O.P., Lives of Freshmen in Transition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lieu, Ted W (1969- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knight, Steve (1966- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stefanik, Elise', 'rank':