c05f'}, {'abstract': 'The private equity firm Silver Lake plans to announce on Wednesday that it has invested $250 million in Red Ventures, which helps companies like DirecTV and MetLife acquire customers.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/07/silver-lake-makes-big-bet-in-red-ventures-a-digital-marketing-company/', 'snippet': 'The private equity firm Silver Lake plans to announce on Wednesday that it has invested $250 million in Red Ventures, which helps companies like DirecTV and MetLife acquire customers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nestled in a suburban town just south of Charlotte, N.C., the digital marketing company Red Ventures has spent most of its nearly 15-year existence in relative obscurity. But two major private equity firms are betting that it will grow into a giant.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-red-ventures/dbpix-red-ventures-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-red-ventures/dbpix-red-ventures-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-red-ventures/dbpix-red-ventures-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-red-ventures/dbpix-red-ventures-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1550, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-red-ventures/dbpix-red-ventures-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't