 change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/01/07/gearing-up-for-re-election-reid-said-to-shake-up-staff/', 'snippet': 'David Krone, the, um, lightning rod to Harry Reid, will be replaced by Drew Willison, the Senate’s former sergeant-at-arms, according to a source familiar with the personnel change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Krone, Senator Harry Reid’s lightning rod — or chief of staff — will be replaced by Drew Willison, the Senate’s former sergeant-at-arms, according to a source familiar with the personnel change.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/politics/07firstdraft-krone/07firstdraft-krone-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/07/us/politics/07firstdraft-krone/07firstdraft-krone-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/politics/07firstdraft-krone/07firstdraft-krone-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/politics/07firstdraft-krone/07firstdraft-krone-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1265, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/07/us/politics/07firstdraft-krone/07firstdraft-krone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/07/us/politics/07firstdraft-krone/07firstdraft-krone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa