preview-shiro-kuramata-and-hiroshi-sugimoto.html', 'snippet': '“Shiro Kuramata and Hiroshi Sugimoto: Works From the Absent Past” at the Wright gallery in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time is arrested in an auction preview of art pieces by two Japanese masters. “Shiro Kuramata and Hiroshi Sugimoto: Works From the Absent Past” displays limited-edition furniture by Mr. Kuramata (1934-1991) alongside photographic seascapes by Mr. Sugimoto. The show is at Wright’s New York gallery, 980 Madison Avenue (East 77th Street).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 926, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 926}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 664, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1327, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR4/08CURR4-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'widt