eview', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1b118bf-20d2-586d-bf34-56d78018e10a', 'word_count': 1034, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1b118bf-20d2-586d-bf34-56d78018e10a'}, {'abstract': 'Martyn Lawrence Bullard designs crystal fit for Eden.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/garden/martyn-lawrence-bullards-crystal-designs-for-daum.html', 'snippet': 'Martyn Lawrence Bullard designs crystal fit for Eden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his first collection for Daum, the French crystal manufacturer, Martyn Lawrence Bullard put an artful twist on a Garden of Eden theme. The infamous apple assumes three forms: a paperweight ($675); a candleholder ($1,470) with a niche for an LED candle; and the centerpiece of a chandelier with pale green leaves and a gilded serpent (price upon request). All are made using the company’s technique of pâte de cristal, a modern refinement of pâte de verre, the ancient Egyptian glass-casting method, which results in the bold, saturated color evident in the ruby red of the apple. They will be introduced at the Maison et Objet home furnishings show in Paris on Jan. 23.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR3/08CURR3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR3/08CURR3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 679}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR3/08CURR3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 912, 'width': 806, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/garden/08CURR3/08CURR3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 912, 'width': 806, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 's