e-fourths of the wind farm’s power, said they were canceling their contracts because Cape Wind had failed to meet a Dec. 31 deadline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — Cape Wind, a massive wind farm proposed in Nantucket Sound, has been dealt a setback that threatens its finances and throws into doubt whether it will become the nation’s first such offshore project. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Plan for Offshore Wind Farm in Nantucket Sound Hits a Snag', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Plan for Offshore Wind Farm Hits a Snag', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wind Power', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cape Wind Associates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NStar', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Grid Plc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nantucket Sound (Mass)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Koch, William I', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, James S', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T00:39:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb92b33a-be3d-5767-a91c-a32accc77ade', 'word_count': 463, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb92b33a-be3d-5767-a91c-a32accc77ade'}, {'abstract': 'On Madison Avenue, well-made clothes that you shouldn’t have to replace very often.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/fashion/at-tomas-maier-a-vision-of-the-closet-as-toolbox-.html', 'snippet': 'On Madison Avenue, well-made clothes that you shouldn’t have to replace very often.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The best way to experience a Tomas Maier store is to emerge from the No. 6 train like a gremlin, brushing subway grime from your coat and scraping your shoe against the ground to remove a spilled slushie that you and 50 other passengers stepped in on the way out. These are conditions that contrast optimally with the new store on Madison Avenue, which is among the cleanest and brightest-lit vendors of luxury goods on its Upper East Side block. It’s the kind of environment you wander into and think, “If I lived in a place like this, I’d never be filthy again.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/fashion/08CRITICAL1/08CRITICAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/fashion/08CRITICAL1/08CRITICAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/fashion/08CRITICAL1/08CRITICAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/fashion/08CRITICAL1/08CRITICAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/fashion/08CRITICAL1/08CRITICAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/08/fashion/08CRITICAL1