nization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c85ac9d-0688-51e0-a109-c20508c10145', 'word_count': 214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c85ac9d-0688-51e0-a109-c20508c10145'}, {'abstract': 'The New York courts, usually bustling with arraignments, have taken on an unusual tranquility after a steep decline in arrests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/nyregion/quiet-in-the-court-drop-in-arrests-slows-new-yorks-busy-legal-system.html', 'snippet': 'The New York courts, usually bustling with arraignments, have taken on an unusual tranquility after a steep decline in arrests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One arraignment courtroom instead of two. Clerks watching “Batman” on their computer screens and playing with their cellphones as they wait for something to happen. And Manhattan’s night court shutting down an hour early because there are no more cases to call.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/08SLOWCOURTY/08SLOWCOURTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/08SLOWCOURTY/08SLOWCOURTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/08SLOWCOURTY/08SLOWCOURTY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/08SLOWCOURTY/08SLOWCOURTY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/08SLOWCOURTY/08SLO