iolate their constitutional rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/nyregion/state-vaccine-requirement-is-lawful-a-2nd-court-says.html', 'snippet': 'An appeals panel ruled on Wednesday that requiring children to be vaccinated before attending public school does not violate their constitutional rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York State’s requirement that children be vaccinated before attending public school does not violate their constitutional rights, a federal appeals court in Manhattan said on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Vaccine Requirement Is Lawful, a 2nd Court Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State Vaccine Requirement Is Lawful, a 2nd Court Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGeehan, Patrick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T03:38:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick McGeehan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/141ef954-1623-52b7-8c89-69502fa2576d', 'word_count': 485, 'uri': 'nyt://article/141ef954-1623-52b7-8c89-69502fa2576d'}, {'abstract': 'In an effort to spot problems, social wo