ck.html', 'snippet': 'Already on high alert after the ambush killings of two officers last month, the New York Police Department on Wednesday urged its patrol force to take further precautions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Police Department, already on high alert after the ambush killings of two officers last month, issued a call for further precautions in the wake of a deadly attack in Paris, including telling its patrol force not to sit in pairs in squad cars when at a fixed post.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Officers on Even Higher Alert After Paris Attack', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officers on Even Higher Alert After Paris Attack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlie Hebdo', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, Wenjian (1982-2014)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ramos, Rafael (1974-2014)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T03:48:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c70412b-aaed-5f7e-b37c-2a7c0a1693d8', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c70412b-aaed-5f7e-b37c-2a7c0a1693d8'}, {'abstract': 'With about 20 police officers looking on, Jason Polanco and Joshua Kemp were arraigned in Bronx Criminal Court on Wednesday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/nyregion/police-shooting-suspect-was-seen-as-defiant-or-gentle.html', 'snippet': 'With about 20 police officers looking on, Jason Polanco and Joshua Kemp were arraigned in Bronx Criminal Court on Wednesday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jason Polanco, who was known to stride out of his local deli with food that he had not always paid for, stepped into a nearby bodega in the Bronx on Monday night with more grandiose plans, according to the police.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/COPS/COPS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/COPS/COPS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/COPS/COPS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/COPS/COPS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/COPS/COPS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/08/nyregion/COPS/COPS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No