 Xinhua. “The runaway was injured during the process and died after treatment failed.” Mr. Hong said the murders by the soldier, which took place in northeast China near the North Korean border, were an individual criminal case. Earlier this week, Chinese officials said they had lodged a formal diplomatic complaint with the North Korean government. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China: North Korean Soldier Dies', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China: North Korean Soldier Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T05:22:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Wong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c1848c9-4ca1-5e1d-9e12-87b26633c6ca', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c1848c9-4ca1-5e1d-9e12-87b26633c6ca'}, {'abstract': 'According to those who knew them and followed their work, the four cartoonists who were killed Wednesday represented a radical, crude and vital strain of French culture.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/world/europe/the-men-behind-the-cartoons-at-charlie-hebdo.html', 'snippet': 'According to those who knew them and followed their work, the four cartoonists who were killed Wednesday represented a radical, crude and vital strain of French culture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The four cartoonists killed in the offices of Ch