s French citizens mourned their dead, the authorities were carrying out an intense search for the brothers suspected of attacking a Paris newspaper.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/09/world/europe/charlie-hebdo-terrorist-attack.html', 'snippet': 'As French citizens mourned their dead, the authorities were carrying out an intense search for the brothers suspected of attacking a Paris newspaper.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — As France mourned, thousands of law enforcement agents mobilized on Thursday in an extensive manhunt for two brothers suspected of killing 12 people, including two police officers, at the satirical newspaper Charlie Hebdo in Paris.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Police Hunt for Suspects in Paris Attack as Nation Mourns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As France Mourns, Police Hunt for Suspects in Newspaper Attack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlie Hebdo', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erlanger, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kouachi, Cherif (1982-2015)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kouachi, Said (1980-2015)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mourad, Hamyd', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Valls, Manuel', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T07:47:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger and Dan Bilefsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'r