/a-brazen-umbrella-thief/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: Stealing umbrellas is common, but on one rainy night, a woman had her open umbrella wrestled right out of her hands.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Dear Diary:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Brazen Umbrella Thief', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Umbrellas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T13:43:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Miriam Silverberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Miriam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silverberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a31233d2-32b2-5232-912c-042f44e1ae7b', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a31233d2-32b2-5232-912c-042f44e1ae7b'}, {'abstract': 'The financial health of Dick’s Sporting Goods suggests that there is ample room for a new private equity owner to generate a nice return, Kevin Allison writes in Reuters Breakingviews.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/dicks-sporting-goods-is-an-attractive-candidate-for-private-equity-firms/', 'snippet': 'The financial health of Dick’s Sporting Goods suggests that there is ample room for a new private equity owner to generate a nice return, Kevin Allison writes in Reuters Breakingviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dick’s Sporting Goods may become the next private equity plaything. The vendor, whose stock is valued at more than $6 billion, is contemplating a leveraged buyout, according to a Reuters report on Wednesday. A relatively clean balance sheet means there is an opportunity to make money. It would, however, require healthy growth assumptions for the company at a time when stiff online competition is challenging many retailers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1303, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/business/dbpix-dicks/dbpix-dicks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dick’s Sporting Goods Is an Attractive Candidate for Private Equity Firms', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 