 2005 Broadway revival of “Sweeney Todd”), will begin performances March 26 at the Lyceum Theater and open on April 23 – the eligibility deadline for 2015 Tony nominations.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chita Rivera and Roger Rees to Star in ‘The Visit’ on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chita Rivera on Broadway', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rees, Roger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Chita', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T20:35:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/040a90ab-b3e3-506c-8784-7b295244245a', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/040a90ab-b3e3-506c-8784-7b295244245a'}, {'abstract': 'The former fashion designer’s first solo exhibition in New York opens tonight at Sperone Westwater.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/helmut-lang-art-show-sperone-westwater/', 'snippet': 'The former fashion designer’s first solo exhibition in New York opens tonight at Sperone Westwater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ten years ago, Helmut Lang sold his stake in his eponymous label and shifted focus to making art at his studio in East Hampton. Tonight, he opens his first New York City solo gallery show at Sperone Westwater in SoHo, presenting a body of sculptural works from 2010 to 2014. Some include repurposed materials from his past vocation, while other, more recent, works comment on the passage of time in a less narrative and more metaphysical way.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1229, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08helmut-hruska-2/08helmut-hruska-2-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside Helmut Lang’s New Art Show', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lang, Helmut', '