ng on the billboard-size painting “Treatise on the Veil (Second Version),” a panoramic canvas measuring nearly 33 feet across that Cy Twombly (1928-2011) made in Rome in 1970.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1127, 'width': 1949, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/arts/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3/09SUBTWOMBLY-GALLERY3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cy Twombly: ‘Treatise on the Veil’', 'kicker': 'Art in Review', 'content_k