ore aggressive agenda.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Heritage Foundation, long known as a font of conservative ideas, is planning a two-day policy conference next week aimed at nudging Republicans toward a more aggressive agenda, just days before House and Senate Republicans are set to hold a joint retreat.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'G.O.P. Faces Push From Right to Be Bolder ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'G.O.P. Faces Push From Right to Be Bolder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Jonathan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Heritage Foundation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Ted', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeMint, Jim', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Rand', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Heritage Action for America', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-08T22:10:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62a3fc97-fe83-55ba-8bd8-1afdc8050daf', 'word_count': 399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62a3fc97-fe83-55ba-8bd8-1afdc8050daf'}, {'abstract': 'As members of the newly well-heeled tech elite look to invest their money, the city’s small but thriving gallery scene is finding itself the recipient of their attention.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/08/san-francisco-gallery-scene-zlot-buell-jessica-silverman-ratio-3/', 'snippet': 'As members of the newly well-heeled tech elite look to invest their money, the city’s small but thriving gallery scene is finding itself the recipient of their attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'San Francisco, as has been well documented, is undergoing seismic cultural shifts. The second technology boom has brought an influx of wealth, investors and start-up prospectors to the city, drawing parallels with the gold rush of 1849. Now, as members of the newly well-heeled tech elite look to invest their money, the city’s small but thriving gallery scene is finding itself the recipient of their attention.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08hartman-sf3/08hartman-sf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08hartman-sf3/08hartman-sf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08hartman-sf3/08hartman-sf3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08hartman-sf3/08hartman-sf3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/08/t-magazine/08hartman-sf3/08hartman-sf3-thumbStandard.jp