4-6b2e-57b7-a618-06da2553898d'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s initiative, which would expand educational opportunities for millions, is another attempt to address persistent income inequality.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/09/us/politics/obama-proposes-free-community-college-education-for-some-students.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s initiative, which would expand educational opportunities for millions, is another attempt to address persistent income inequality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama said Thursday that he would propose a government program to make community college tuition-free for millions of students, an ambitious plan that would expand educational opportunities across the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/us/09OBAMA1-web/09OBAMA1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/09/us/09OBAMA1-web/09OBAMA1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/us/09OBAMA1-web/09OBAMA1-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/us/09OBAMA1-web/09OBAMA1-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/us/09OBAMA1-web/09OBAMA1-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/09/us/09OBAMA1-web/09