 Bill de Blasio. But perhaps something else is at work: Neither the ticket agents nor the officers have had a new contract since 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hoisting boxes of chicken parts from a truck at 1 p.m. on Thursday afternoon, Victor Arroyo did not, at first, notice the four police officers strolling up Ninth Avenue in Midtown Manhattan. He stepped off the tailgate and stacked the boxes on a dolly for his partner to roll inside a butcher store. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ticket Falloff, 2 Officers’ Deaths and Overdue Contracts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ticket Falloff, 2 Officers’ Deaths and Overdue Contracts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic and Parking Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dwyer, Jim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T02:08:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dwyer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dwyer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40ff118b-9992-58ee-893b-f9fa5c865344', 'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40ff118b-9992-58ee-893b-f9fa5c865344'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Maccagnan, Houston’s director of college scouting, was scheduled to speak with the Jets for a second time on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/09/sports/football/mike-maccagnan-emerges-as-favorite-for-jets-gm-position.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Maccagnan, Houston’s director of college scouting, was scheduled to speak with the Jets for a second time on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A favorite has been established in the Jets’ general manager search: Mike Maccagnan, the Houston Texans’ director of college scouting. Maccagnan, the only candidate the Jets have asked back for a second interview, was scheduled to speak with the team again on Friday. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': ' Jets Focus on Texans Executive in G.M. Hunt', 'kicker': 'N.F.L. Roundup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jets Focus on Texans Executive in G.M. Hunt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maccagnan, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Texans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T02:15:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1d3e7da-c815-5e51-a9d5-f36cd9b82556', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1d3e7da-c815-5e51-a9d5-f36cd9b82556'}, {'abstract': 'The House passed a bill changing the definition of the workweek from 30 hours to 40 hours, which proponents say would save businesses with 50 or more employees from having to make cuts in other parts of their businesses to pay for health care coverage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/09/us/