rom passing vehicles. A sitting comptroller could wear a sash and parade down the Canyon of Heroes after a budget triumph and remain anonymous to all but a few devotees of municipal arcana.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photographs of\xa0Mayor Bill de Blasio, Year One', 'kicker': 'Album', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Down in Front', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T03:15:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afd7841f-abc9-5f21-b5bf-39933bf904ad', 'word_count': 302, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afd7841f-abc9-5f21-b5bf-39933bf904ad'}, {'abstract': 'Photographs from the past week in New York City and the region include scenes from the start of the New Year and the funerals of former Gov. Mario M. Cuomo and Officer Wenjian Liu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/01/09/nyregion/new-york-week-in-pictures.html', 'snippet': 'Photographs from the past week in New York City and the region include scenes from the start of the New Year and the funerals of former Gov. Mario M. Cuomo and Officer Wenjian Liu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photographs from the past week in New York City and the region include scenes from the start of the New Year and the funerals of former Gov. Mario M. Cuomo and Officer Wenjian Liu.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'x