it is to leave.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Visual Beauty and History in Hartford', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Delano, Jack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Delano, Pablo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Connecticut Historical Society', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALBANY (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Caribbean Area', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hartford (Conn)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T10:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pablo Delano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pablo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Delano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb96a06f-32d9-5b2f-9d55-682a70431bfe', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb96a06f-32d9-5b2f-9d55-682a70431bfe'}, {'abstract': 'The unemployment rate fell to its lowest level since June 2008, but average hourly earnings fell 0.2 percent, erasing some of the gains of last month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/10/business/economy/jobs-unemployment-figures-december.html', 'snippet': 'The unemployment rate fell to its lowest level since June 2008, but average hourly earnings fell 0.2 percent, erasing some of the gains of last month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The nation’s economy is entering 2015 in its best shape since the recession, but the improving job market has so far failed to help most Americans earn significantly more at work. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/business/10jobs-web1/10jobs-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Job Growth Fails to Help Paychecks of Workers', 'kicker': None, 'c