': 'Shortages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maduro, Nicolas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "McDonald's Corporation", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T15:01:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ernesto Londo&#241;o', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ernesto', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Londo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a49f2cf-ba19-5788-8397-093e117fe268', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a49f2cf-ba19-5788-8397-093e117fe268'}, {'abstract': 'Questions about parking disputes, relationships, unwanted gifts and declining a Facebook invitation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/style/social-qs-blocked-in.html', 'snippet': 'Questions about parking disputes, relationships, unwanted gifts and declining a Facebook invitation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I live in a town that is notoriously difficult for parking. After years of circling blocks for spaces, I found an apartment with a garage. Then a business moved in, and one of its employees started parking in front of my garage every day. I only use my car occasionally, but when I do, I have to ask her to move hers. She does it right away, but it’s still annoying. The other day I told her it had to stop. She was furious and called me selfish (because I use the car infrequently). Was I wrong?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Blocked In', 'kicker': 'Social Q’s', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Blocked In', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs, Etiquette and Manners', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parking Garages and Lots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T15:03:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article',