plus video.)', 'lead_paragraph': 'A lentil salad can be tasty. It can be healthy. But it’s rarely pretty.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Root of the Matter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Root of the Matter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clark, Melissa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lentils', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T15:43:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/620228e0-ed9a-568d-b2ad-38f46b6ef355', 'word_count': 415, 'uri': 'nyt://article/620228e0-ed9a-568d-b2ad-38f46b6ef355'}, {'abstract': 'Following the Parisian department store’s January tradition, labels such as Dior and Céline have created alabaster items to be sold at the two shops.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/09/webster-bon-marche-white-collection/', 'snippet': 'Following the Parisian department store’s January tradition, labels such as Dior and Céline have created alabaster items to be sold at the two shops.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last September, the Miami retail-scene mainstay the Webster and the Parisian department store Le Bon Marché Rive Gauche approached more than 50\xa0brands with a carte blanche of sorts: the opportunity to design an item for a limited-edition collection to launch in 2015. The (appropriate) caveat? Each contribution had to be rendered in white, as part of “le mois du blanc” (“the month of white”), a Bon Marché tradition\xa0since\xa0January 1873, when the store’s founder Aristide Boucicaut stocked a selection of snow-hued garments to fill his shelves following the holiday shopping season.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/t-magazine/09marche-moss/09marche-moss-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Webster and Le Bon Marché Join Forces for an All-White Series of Designer Collaborations', '