1940-chamberlain-speaks-on-war/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from The International Herald Tribune archives: 1940: Chamberlain Speaks on the Course of the War.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In a fifty-five-minute address to an enthusiastic gathering of notables in the Mansion House, Prime Minister Neville Chamberlain reviewed the course of the war, affirming once again Britain’s determination, with the aid of ‘‘our dauntless French Allies’’ to bring it to a successful conclusion, but warning his listeners that the road ahead might be a long one and most certainly hard.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/blogs/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 429, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/blogs/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1025, 'width': 429, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/blogs/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/10/blogs/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/blogs/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain/10-iht-retrospective-chamberlain-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1940: Chamber