url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/10/upshot/obamas-community-college-plan-a-reading-list.html', 'snippet': 'A guide to the debate over President Obama’s plan to make community college free for many students — and the local programs that have already done so.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama is in Tennessee on Friday, along with the state’s Republican governor and two Republican senators, to lay out his plan for free community college. The plan — which would require congressional approval — would apply to students attending a two-year college, including part time, so long as the college offered credits that could transfer to a four-year college or provided training that led to jobs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/upshot/10UP-Reading-List/10UP-Reading-List-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/14/upshot/10UP-Reading-List/10UP-Reading-List-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/upshot/10UP-Reading-List/10UP-Reading-List-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/upshot/10UP-Reading-List/10UP-Reading-List-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/upshot/10UP-Reading-List/10UP-Reading-List-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/14/upshot/10UP-Reading-List/10UP-Readin