omputers serve as matchmakers and bid-and-ask quotations aren’t displayed to all participants. What’s surprising is just how big the dark-trading market has become.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Rise of Trading in the Dark', 'kicker': 'Datapoints', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Rise of Trading in the Dark', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TABB Group LLC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-09T21:44:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Mutual Funds', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna Bernasek', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernasek', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28b40282-de26-5cd6-8611-060525f94140', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28b40282-de26-5cd6-8611-060525f94140'}, {'abstract': 'How liquid are mutual funds’ investments? Regulators are considering the question as they examine the industry for several areas of risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/business/gauging-funds-emergency-preparedness.html', 'snippet': 'How liquid are mutual funds’ investments? Regulators are considering the question as they examine the industry for several areas of risk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHENEVER markets are hot, mutual fund companies tend to go far off the beaten track in their hunt for better returns.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'pri