thout clothes, by its choreographers Molly Lieber and Eleanor Smith as part of PS122’s Coil festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/10/arts/dance/rude-world-a-dance-by-molly-lieber-and-eleanor-smith.html', 'snippet': '“Rude World” is performed without words, and largely without clothes, by its choreographers Molly Lieber and Eleanor Smith as part of PS122’s Coil festival.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Rude World,” the title of a new duet choreographed and performed by Molly Lieber and Eleanor Smith, might refer to all that the dance appears at first to exclude. The walls of the tiny Chocolate Factory theater, where the work was performed on Thursday as part of PS 122’s Coil festival, have been draped in black, the floor covered in black vinyl. The two women, entirely silent and naked most of the time, could be alone, dancing only for each other. Dancing with each other, they intertwine, skin to skin. Their world seems self-contained. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/arts/rude/rude-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/10/arts/rude/rude-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/arts/rude/rude-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/arts/rude/rude-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 1066, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/10/arts/rude/rude-thumbStandard.jpg', 'he