attack it had planned in the same area. It did not offer details about its planned attack. The Turkish news media has reported that the bomber was a Russian citizen of Chechen descent. An investigation is underway, the Interior Ministry said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkey: Leftists Retract Their Claim About an Attack', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey: Leftists Retract Their Claim About an Attack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yeginsu, Ceylan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Revolutionary People's Liberation Party-Front (Turkey)", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istanbul (Turkey)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-10T01:15:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ceylan Yeginsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ceylan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yeginsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a42130c1-d7bc-5b2c-b690-69625cf6467f', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a42130c1-d7bc-5b2c-b690-69625cf6467f'}, {'abstract': 'Readers react to an Op-Ed essay by a former officer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/10/opinion/police-vs-de-blasio-examining-the-reasons.html', 'snippet': 'Readers react to an Op-Ed essay by a former officer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Police vs. de Blasio: Examining the Reasons', 'kicker': 'L