, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/multimedia/20150111billcunningham/20150111billcunningham-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1927, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/multimedia/20150111billcunningham/20150111billcunningham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/09/multimedia/20150111billcunningham/20150111billcunningham-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/09/multimedia/20150111billcunningham/20150111billcunningham-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Fashion’s Deep Freeze', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coats and Jackets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bryant Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-10T01:58:09+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'Joanna Nikas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nikas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/21893cff-74bd-545b-a480-c2149ac42cae', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/21893cff-74bd-545b-a480-c2149ac42cae'}, {'abstract': 'A surprise was the sight of many capes and ponchos, which are not very practical in the cold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/fashion/bill-cunningham-fashions-deep-freeze.html', 'snippet': 'A surprise was the sight of many capes and ponchos, which are not very practical in the cold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All the drama of winter cold arrived just as the last holiday tourist throngs left the city on Monday. In Bryant Park, on the Sixth Avenue side, the fountain was covered in icicles. By Friday, the fountain was no longer visible. Members of the usually politically correct fashion crowd pulled out their fur coats. Cellphones disappeared, and hands clutched hot cups of coffee instead. The few visitors to the city who were left after the cold set in still had breakfast at Tiffany & Co., even as their teeth chattered. A surprise was the sight of many capes and ponchos, which are not very practical in the cold. More practical were the belted coats. And while no one was turning blue from the cold, several fashionable women wore blue coats, and one young man appeared in a silk, quilted coat.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Fashion’s Deep Freeze', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deep Freeze', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coats and Jackets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fur', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tiffany & Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bryant Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-10T01:59:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_na