, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17af0049-7cea-519f-8310-95a7c03ee77a'}, {'abstract': 'The chief executive of Bluemercury says she looks for three main qualities in job candidates. “If you’re hungry to get somewhere, that means you want to learn,” she says. “And if you want to learn, you can do any job.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/business/corner-office-marla-malcolm-becks-three-keys-to-hiring-skill-will-and-fit.html', 'snippet': 'The chief executive of Bluemercury says she looks for three main qualities in job candidates. “If you’re hungry to get somewhere, that means you want to learn,” she says. “And if you want to learn, you can do any job.”', 'lead_paragraph': ' This interview with  Marla Malcolm Beck, chief executive of Bluemercury, a beauty products and spa services retailer, was conducted and condensed by  Adam Bryant.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/11/business/11-CORNER/11-CORNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/11/business/11-CORNER/11-CORNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 916}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/11/business/11-CORNER/11-CORNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/11/business/11-CORNER/11-CORNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/11/business/11-CORNER/11-CORNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'