ism since the Sept. 11 attacks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Huge Show of Solidarity in Paris Against Terrorism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Huge Show of Solidarity in Paris Against Terrorism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlie Hebdo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Speech and Expression', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-11T08:59:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Alderman and Dan Bilefsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alderman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilefsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48cc17bb-578f-5bc5-94e3-e79e6f3b9b13', 'word_count': 1354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48cc17bb-578f-5bc5-94e3-e79e6f3b9b13'}, {'abstract': 'Efforts to stop opium cultivation and heroin production have been stymied by poor farmers who have few alternative to support their families.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/an-eternal-dilemma-in-the-golden-triangle/', 'snippet': 'Efforts to stop opium cultivation and heroin production have been stymied by poor farmers who have few alternative to support their families.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For more than 40 years, opium poppies have been cultivated and processed into heroin in the Golden Triangle, a mountainous area that straddles the borders of Myanmar, Laos and Thailand. Along with Afghanistan, it has supplied most of the world’s heroin.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Eternal Dilemma in the Golden Triangle', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heroin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opium', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poppies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fuller, Thomas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Laos', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-11T10:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d07ef833-9c29-51bd-b62f-c48bb986bde4', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d07ef833-9c29-51bd-b62f-c48bb986bde4'}, {'abstract': 'London', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/01/11/fashion/runway-mens/jw-anderson-fall-2015-menswear.html', 'snippet': 'London', 'lead_paragraph': 'London', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/11/fashion/runway-mens/jwanderson-mens-slide-XLRQ/jwanderson-mens-slide-XLRQ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/11/fashion/runway-mens/jwanderson-mens-slide-XLRQ/jwanderson-mens-slide-XLRQ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'c