 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/db221fb9-6586-5416-a836-4d2cb434767e'}, {'abstract': 'The men’s wear shows, newly expanded to four days, kick off the fall 2015 season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/12/fashion/coach-and-public-school-add-a-us-flair-to-london-collections-men.html', 'snippet': 'The men’s wear shows, newly expanded to four days, kick off the fall 2015 season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — New Year’s Eve is barely a faded memory by the time the January men’s wear runway circuit grinds into gear. Christmas is still within spitting distance. For those whose job it is to make or follow men’s clothing, who gather with back-to-school regularity, the post-holiday precipice is steep. When the troops gathered in London last week for the newly expanded London Collections: Men shows, many still sported tans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/fashion/12men-A/12men-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/12/fashion/12men-A/12men-A-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/fashion/12men-A/12men-A-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/fashion/12men-A/12men-A-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/fashion/12men-A/12men-A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/12/