n people joined world leaders on the streets of Paris on Sunday for a rally and march under extraordinary security after a series of terrorist attacks in the city. Elsewhere in France, and around the world, hundreds of thousands of people showed their support for freedom of expression and to honor the 17 people killed last week in Paris.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris March Draws More Than 1 Million Into the Streets', 'kicker': 'News', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlie Hebdo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-11T14:12:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad3305d1-e169-5749-aaa8-a245f5b718a3', 'word_count': 5245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad3305d1-e169-5749-aaa8-a245f5b718a3'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from The International Herald Tribune archives: Russians inflict heavy losses on Germans.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/11/1915-russian-columns-advancing-into-transylvania/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from The International Herald Tribune archives: Russians inflict heavy losses on Germans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PETROGRAD — Only skirmishing actions are reported in the latest official communiqués from the Polish and Caucasian fronts. Grand Duke Nicholas remains intentionally vague about the movements in Galicia and Bukowina. To-day’s [Jan. 11] statement from the Great General Staff says that on the left bank of the Vistula the Germans attempted yesterday and during the night to attack the Russian front at several points, but were repulsed by artillery fire. In an attack near the village of Sarnice, east of Skierniewice, the Germans reached the barbed wire protecting the Russian trenches and shouted: “Don’t fire on your own men!” The Russians, however, failed to be taken in by this worn-out ruse and replied with a murderous fire and inflicted heavy losses on the enemy.— The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 12, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1915: Russian Columns Advancing Into Transylvania', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Transylvania (Romania)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-11T14:28:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/538a59b1-5a90-5f2b-af3d-79613ddfb11f', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/538a59b1-5a90-5f2b-af3d-79613ddfb11f'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the London Fashion Week photo diary of Kasia Bobula.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/01/11/t-magazine/11scene-fashioneast.html', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the London Fashion Week photo diary of Kasia Bobula.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scenes from the London Fashion Week photo diary of Kasia Bobula.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/11