uest is going to be an incredible rock ’n’ roll icon, a guitar god,” Ms. Perry said, adding that other artists would be added. “He’s going to make me so much cooler that day,” she said. The Super Bowl takes place on Feb. 1 in Glendale, Ariz. Ms. Perry, 30, is currently on a world tour in support of her 2013 album, “Prism.” \xa0Mr. Kravitz, 50, will begin the second leg of his international “Strut” tour in March.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 796, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 796}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1110, 'width': 837, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/ARTS3/ARTS3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kravitz to Join  Super Bowl Show', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly'