rmed in her first New York show as a solo artist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/12/arts/neneh-cherry-at-the-highline-ballroom.html', 'snippet': 'Neneh Cherry, best known for her 1980s hit “Buffalo Stance,” performed in her first New York show as a solo artist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Neneh Cherry had international hits in the late 1980s and early 1990s, when she was a sassy young woman in her 20s, immersed in London’s overlapping post-punk, hip-hop and club cultures. She fused them in songs like “Buffalo Stance,” in 1988, rapping and singing about pimping, poverty, dancing and love. Now 50, she was just as bold in her New York City solo debut on Friday night at the Highline Ballroom. “It’s kind of a deep thing that this is actually at last happening,” she said. “It’s about the now, right here, right now.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/CHERRY/CHERRY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 342, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/CHERRY/CHERRY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 342}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/CHERRY/CHERRY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 584, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/CHERRY/CHERRY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1167, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/arts/CHERRY/CHERRY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima