on a trajectory away from democracy, elected a relative unknown who promised a weaker presidency, not another king.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/12/world/asia/groundswell-chooses-democracy-in-sri-lanka.html', 'snippet': 'In a surprise to analysts last week, Sri Lanka, which had been on a trajectory away from democracy, elected a relative unknown who promised a weaker presidency, not another king.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Across the great Eurasian plate these days, from Belarus to Beijing, one can find leaders dispensing with truly competitive politics. But traverse the Himalayas to South Asia and the climate is different: Democracy is on a winning streak.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/world/SRILANKA-1/SRILANKA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/12/world/SRILANKA-1/SRILANKA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/world/SRILANKA-1/SRILANKA-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/world/SRILANKA-1/SRILANKA-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1282, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/world/SRILANKA-1/SRILANKA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/12/world/SRILANKA-1/SRILANKA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh