ad_paragraph': 'In a new challenge to South Carolina’s embattled foster care program, child-welfare activists filed a lawsuit in federal court on Monday claiming that widespread deficiencies in the system have endangered thousands of children.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suit Alleges Widespread Deficiencies in South Carolina Foster Care', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foster Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Department of Social Services', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-12T16:36:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Blinder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd200092-fb6d-5edd-ad88-38c07e498fd5', 'word_count': 662, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd200092-fb6d-5edd-ad88-38c07e498fd5'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from The International Herald Tribune archives: 1915: A battle royal in the sky at an altitude of 9,000ft.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/12/1915-a-battle-royal-in-the-sky/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from The International Herald Tribune archives: 1915: A battle royal in the sky at an altitude of 9,000ft.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A thrilling sequel to the German aerial raid on Dunkirk, a battle royal 9,000 feet above the ground between two Belgian aeroplanes and seven enemy machines, has become known here. As shrapnel and rifle bullets from the anti-aircraft guns were pattering down on houses, two plucky Belgian aviators took to the air and engaged seven foes. Rapidly outmaneuvering the hostile pilots, the Belgians ascended, and half hidden by the thin gray clouds, they poured a hail of bullets from their machine-guns. As fast as the remaining German planes rose, the Belgians climbed more swiftly, until the final phase of the duel was decided at an altitude of 9,000ft. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 13, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/blogs/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal-jumbo.png', 'height': 522, 'width': 431, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/blogs/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal-superJumbo.png', 'height': 522, 'width': 431, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/blogs/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/13/blogs/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/blogs/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal/13-iht-retrospective-battle-royal-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1915: A Battle Royal in the Sky', 'kicker': 'IH