: 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-12T17:27:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Barone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f03ea54-fc37-59a0-91df-084ecf8eee0a', 'word_count': 700, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f03ea54-fc37-59a0-91df-084ecf8eee0a'}, {'abstract': 'The actors William H. Macy and Adrien Brody and the musician Common buttoned up dark layers beneath their navy tuxedos.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/12/golden-globes-2015-mens-looks/', 'snippet': 'The actors William H. Macy and Adrien Brody and the musician Common buttoned up dark layers beneath their navy tuxedos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was a time when wearing a navy tuxedo during awards season seemed a revolutionary choice for men. But after last night’s Golden Globes, it’s safe to say what was once a risky move has nowadays become commonplace. Plenty of navy tuxedos walked down the red carpet yesterday evening; however, the above men took it a step further. The actors William H. Macy and Adrien Brody and the musician Common — who won\xa0the award for Best Original Song for the film “Selma” — opted against the traditional crisp white shirt that actors are wont to wear with their evening suits and instead buttoned up dark layers beneath, creating dapper monochromatic looks that were just a bit more exciting than the basic navy tux.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/12/t-magazine/12globes-tudela/12globes-tudela-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Monochrome Men’s Looks at the Golden Globes', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brody, Adrien', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Macy, William H', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-12T17:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Tudela', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tudela', 'qualifier': None, 