agazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Tudela', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tudela', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/522971b7-a8c6-57b1-b6b6-3c22802637c2', 'word_count': 310, 'uri': 'nyt://article/522971b7-a8c6-57b1-b6b6-3c22802637c2'}, {'abstract': 'The start of the rest of John Galliano’s fashion life had its own hashtag, #MargielaMonday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/fashion/john-galliano-returns-to-the-runway-with-maison-martin-margiela.html', 'snippet': 'The start of the rest of John Galliano’s fashion life had its own hashtag, #MargielaMonday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The klieg lights went up on Act III of John Galliano’s career on a rainy Monday here, on the fourth floor of a brand-new eco-sensitive glass and steel office tower just around the corner from New Scotland Yard and behind Buckingham Palace. In case you missed it: new building, new businesslike beginning.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Galliano’s Back, on Tiptoes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Galliano’s Back, on Tiptoes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Galliano, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Maison Martin Margiela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-12T20:30:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/103fec34-1cfd-582e-8654-c36ff3788a0b', 'word_count': 964, 'uri': 'nyt://article/103fec34-1cfd-582e-8654-c36ff3788a0b'}, {'abstract': 'Yorkville Endoscopy has failed to correct the deficiencies implicated in Ms. Rivers’s death, according to a letter from the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/nyregion/clinic-that-treated-joan-rivers-losing-medicare-and-medicaid.html', 'snippet': 'Yorkville Endoscopy has failed to correct the deficiencies implicated in Ms. Rivers’s death, according to a letter from the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Manhattan clinic where Joan Rivers went into cardiac arrest while being treated for a voice problem has failed to correct deficiencies implicated in her death and will be prohibited from having its services paid for by Medicare and Medicaid funds, according to a letter released on Monday from the federal agency that oversees those two programs.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/RIVERSweb1/RIVERSweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 947, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/RIVERSweb1/RIVERSweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 947}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/RIVERSweb1/RIVERSweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 649, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/RIVERSweb1/RIVERSweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1298, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'super