, the annual world-music showcase, on Sunday night at Webster Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To a traditionalist, the Nile Project might look like an ungainly mélange: a gathering of musicians from the 11 countries of the Nile basin, playing instruments that weren’t made to share a stage or a song. They included an Egyptian wooden flute, an oud, African harps, a thumb piano, a saxophone. But at Globalfest, the annual world-music showcase on Sunday night at Webster Hall, the Nile Project was a committed, euphoric international coalition.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Worlds and Rhythms Meet, in Euphoric Result', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Worlds and Rhythms Meet, in Euphoric Result', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Globalfest', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nile Project', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-12T22:38:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9d5303a-c4a3-5cba-8573-ba69014f0af6', 'word_count': 840, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9d5303a-c4a3-5cba-8573-ba69014f0af6'}, {'abstract': 'Images of some of the performers at the world-music showcase Globalfest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/01/12/arts/music/20140113GLOBAL.html', 'snippet': 'Images of some of the performers at the world-music showcase Globalfest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Images of some of the performers at the world-music showcase Globalfest.', 'source': 'The New