e and others drew a large turnout as the de Blasio administration introduced the country’s largest municipal identification program.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/nyregion/new-york-citys-id-card-program-draws-a-large-response.html', 'snippet': 'New identification cards issued by the city to help undocumented immigrants, homeless people and others drew a large turnout as the de Blasio administration introduced the country’s largest municipal identification program.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The applicants clustered on Kissena Boulevard, clutching documents from around the world, trading familiar stories with strangers in a driving rain outside the Queens Library in Flushing. There were the police encounters, the school visits, the fraught hospital trips — all negotiated without the bureaucratic lubricant of local identification.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/IDCARDS2/IDCARDS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/IDCARDS2/IDCARDS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/IDCARDS2/IDCARDS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/IDCARDS2/IDCARDS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/IDCARDS2/IDCARDS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumb