estinian Authority moved to join the court last month as part of a strategic shift by the Palestinians to pursue statehood on their own after decades of failed negotiations with Israel brokered by the United States.\xa0 Mr. Obama also told Mr. Netanyahu that Washington wanted a comprehensive deal that would prevent Iran from acquiring a nuclear weapon, the White House said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Assures Netanyahu That U.S. Opposes Palestinians’ Bid to Join Court', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Assures Netanyahu That U.S. Opposes Palestinians’ Bid to Join Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Julie Hirschfeld', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Criminal Court', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Palestinian Authority', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBAS, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T03:50:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Hirschfeld Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'Hirschfeld', 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'n