w one called Gartbreck is set to open there this spring. And this year Laphroaig, arguably the smokiest of the distilleries on Islay, celebrates its 200th anniversary.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Scottish Distillery Celebrates 200 Years by Changing Absolutely Nothing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T05:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Nichols', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nichols', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/07336edd-af0c-5895-8387-caaff0afde05', 'word_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07336edd-af0c-5895-8387-caaff0afde05'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 88 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/word-of-the-day-delta/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 88 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'delta •\\ˈdel-tə\\• noun ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day | delta', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T05:02:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/59734bf6-03d2-56e5-a776-ec6b338a8c7a', 'word_count': 268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/59734bf6-03d2-56e5-a776-ec6b338a8c7a'}, {'abstract': 'After Latisha Hopewell’s older daughter began asking questions about why she had left college, she knew it was time to pursue a degree.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/nyregion/going-back-to-college-and-teaching-her-daughters-the-value-of-education.html', 'snippet': 'After Latisha Hopewell’s older daughter began asking questions about why she had left college, she knew it was time to pursue a degree.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A white Christmas tree and a pair of children’s pink-and-white bicycles lined the entryway of Latisha Hopewell’s apartment in Lower Manhattan, where her two daughters, Shaun, 11, and Shani, 6, were losing their battle against post-holiday malaise minute by minute.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/13/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type