ed Ohio State to the brink of the inaugural College Football Playoff championship, and it was the least they could do.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Big Ten to Big One', 'kicker': 'Ohio State 42, Oregon 20', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Big Ten to Big One', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Cardale', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Football Playoff National Championship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ohio State University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Oregon', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T05:11:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Rohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b21aa1f-d0a7-5dc2-b6ca-80d3a42f4e30', 'word_count': 1362, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b21aa1f-d0a7-5dc2-b6ca-80d3a42f4e30'}, {'abstract': 'In a move that is a first for the team, and will give players more Jeff Pentland will direct the hitting duties and Alan Cockrell will be his assistant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/sports/baseball/jeff-pentland-and-alan-cockrell-hired-to-jointly-coach-batters.html', 'snippet': 'In a move that is a first for the team, and will give players more Jeff Pentland will direct the hitting duties and Alan Cockrell will be his assistant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Brian Cashman was interviewing candidates for the Yankees’ hitting coach opening, they told him that the job w