re they had made their homes but in what was described as their homeland. The funeral for the four Jews killed Friday in a terrorist attack on a kosher market in Paris was at once emotional and political, underscoring the tension roiling in recent days between a call for mass immigration to Israel and a demand to protect diaspora communities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Emotion Mixes With Politics as 4 Killed at Paris Market Are Buried in Jerusalem ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Emotion Mixes With Politics as 4 Killed at Paris Market Are Buried in Jerusalem', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rudoren, Jodi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jerusalem (Israel)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coulibaly, Amedy (1982-2015)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T10:48:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jodi Rudoren', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jodi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rudoren', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddf0b6d1-38c9-5ab1-a024-8ec970b4912c', 'word_count': 1155, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddf0b6d1-38c9-5ab1-a024-8ec970b4912c'}, {'abstract': 'Collections range from escape hatches, like Casely-Hayford, to the fantasy mountain men at Moschino.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/14/fashion/london-mens-wear-burberry-mcqueen-and-others-puncture-the-fashion-bubble.html', 'snippet': 'Collections range from escape hatches, like Casely-Hayford, to the fantasy mountain men at Moschino.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The most telling cameo at the four-day men’s wear shows here, the kickoff of the fall 2015 multicity men’s fashion circuit, was not from the three-piece-suited David Gandy, the male model better recognized in his Dolce & Gabbana-ad skivvies; the visiting designers of the American labels Public School and Coach in town to show their wares; or any of the unplaceable Brit rockers at Burberry. It was by the most unlikely guest star of all: the plastic bag, making arguably its most prominent cultural appearance since “American Beauty.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/fashion/14fashion-AA/14fashion-AA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/14/fashion/14fashion-AA/14fashion-AA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/fashion/14fashion-AA/14fashion-AA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/fashion/14fashion-AA/14fashion-AA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/fashion/14fa