n or Spaniards. Navacerrada, the ski center near this capital, has been in existence since before the Spanish Civil War. But it is since the war that it has really developed. If there is any doubt that Spaniards like to ski, figures show that on an average Sunday as many as 12,000 of them appear at Navacerrada. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Jan. 14, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Good Skiing Near Madrid', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T15:19:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6ca3aa4-464c-551d-a499-529b20b33c6b', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6ca3aa4-464c-551d-a499-529b20b33c6b'}, {'abstract': 'Maybe, back when we had so much more of it, I left enough money in a coat pocket to buy the gallon of milk I can’t afford now.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/suburban-poverty-hidden-on-tree-lined-streets/', 'snippet': 'Maybe, back when we had so much more of it, I left enough money in a coat pocket to buy the gallon of milk I can’t afford now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sticking my hands between the cushions, I blindly dig through the maze of lint and mashed-up cracker pieces. Coming up empty handed, I start to pick at the thin layer of dust that has collected beneath my fingernails. Nervously, I start on my cuticles as well, as I often do when I am stressed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-articleLarge.png', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-jumbo.png', 'height': 464, 'width': 702, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-superJumbo.png', 'height': 464, 'width': 702, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/13/us/motherlode-suburbs/motherlode-suburbs-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Suburban Poverty, Hidden on Tree-Lined Streets', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va