c0-8a34-a9b6f454ec55', 'word_count': 132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c6556aa-416a-53c0-8a34-a9b6f454ec55'}, {'abstract': 'John McCain, who is certain that he would have made a better commander in chief than President Obama, takes the reins of the Senate Armed Services Committee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/14/us/politics/john-mccain-78-and-untamed-savors-senate-dream-job.html', 'snippet': 'John McCain, who is certain that he would have made a better commander in chief than President Obama, takes the reins of the Senate Armed Services Committee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — One by one, Senator John McCain’s fellow prisoners from the Vietnam War have been dying, and at 78, he said, he is aware more than ever that his time will come, too. “Every single day,” he mused in an interview, “is a day less that I am going to be able to serve in the Senate.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/us/subMccain/subMccain-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/14/us/subMccain/subMccain-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/us/subMccain/subMccain-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/us/subMccain/subMccain-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/us/subMccain/subMccain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't