 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/9666565e-5988-569c-bb1f-a8edfff5b74c'}, {'abstract': 'Harold Holzer, who has been a fixture at the Met and is currently the senior vice president for public affairs there, will retire this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/13/a-stalwart-at-the-metropolitan-museum-of-art-to-step-down/', 'snippet': 'Harold Holzer, who has been a fixture at the Met and is currently the senior vice president for public affairs there, will retire this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For members of the press, Harold Holzer has been as much a staple of the Metropolitan Museum of Art as the Arms and Armor wing. He seemed to try to move on before — in 2005, when he was given additional responsibility for visitor services and the Multicultural Audience Development Initiative, and in 2013, when he assumed the new title of senior vice president for public affairs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/arts/13artsbeat-holzer/13artsbeat-holzer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 886, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/14/arts/13artsbeat-holzer/13artsbeat-holzer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 886}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/arts/13artsbeat-holzer/13artsbeat-holzer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 694, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/arts/13artsbeat-holzer/13artsbeat-holzer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1292, 'width': 875, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/14/arts/13artsb