ts groups, just 11 protesters lined the sidewalk outside the Capitol Hill Club at an event for Representative Steve Scalise, under fire for appearing in front of white supremacists more than a decade ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/01/13/at-scalise-event-protesters-outnumber-reporters-barely/', 'snippet': 'Despite some build-up by civil rights groups, just 11 protesters lined the sidewalk outside the Capitol Hill Club at an event for Representative Steve Scalise, under fire for appearing in front of white supremacists more than a decade ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Blame it on the wind chill or the midafternoon hour, but a demonstration Tuesday outside an event for Representative Steve Scalise, the Louisiana Republican who has been under fire for speaking to a group of white supremacists in 2002, drew only slightly more protesters than reporters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Scalise Event, Protesters Outnumber Reporters. Barely.', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scalise, Steve', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-13T22:57:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40ac90c4-8af4-5499-9377-07219de297c0', 'word_count': 242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40ac90c4-8af4-5499-