he rouble takes a drop following the budget announcement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PETERSBURG — The Budget announcement has made a very unfavorable impression. The Finance Minister has himself admitted how real and widespread is the agricultural distress, and has publicly declared the opinion that there will be an immediate fall in the value of the rouble. Yet he has calmly augmented the expenditure by no less than 60,000,000 roubles. Probably the Minister could not help himself against the pressure of the war party. It is significant that most of the increase is due to the demands of the War Office. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 15, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1890: The Rouble Takes a Drop', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ruble (Currency)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-14T14:14:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd30bad3-2c3a-55a0-95e6-83b09a2e2a8f', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd30bad3-2c3a-55a0-95e6-83b09a2e2a8f'}, {'abstract': 'Sales volume has picked up in the last year, though home prices have continued to fall since a momentary rebound in early 2011.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/realestate/real-estate-in-slovenia.html', 'snippet': 'Sales volume has picked up in the last year, though home prices have continued to fall since a momentary rebound in early 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A FIVE-BEDROOM COUNTRY HOUSE WITH VIEWS OF THE JULIAN ALPS', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'House Hunting in ... Slovenia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'House Hunting in ... Slovenia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Slovenia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-14T14:30:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Sigal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sigal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2cd0c69-f8d6-5dd5-b463-2bd9d79165cf', 'word_count': 1183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2cd0c69-f8d6-5dd5-b463-2bd9d79165cf'}, {'abstract': 'Mountain views in California, a colonial-style house in Massachusetts and a lakeside setting in Minnesota', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/realestate/homes-for-sale-in-california-massachusetts-and-minnesota.html', 'snippet': 'Mountain views in California, a colonial-style house in Massachusetts and a lakeside setting in Minnesota', 'lead_paragraph': 'RANCHO MIRAGE, CALIF.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What You Get for ... $2,300,000', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What You Get for ... $2,300,000', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Coachella Valley (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'gl