make the cut in the very crowded race for a best actor Oscar nomination? We’ll know Thursday, but either way, 2014 was a breakout year for him, with a raved-about performance as the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. in “Selma” and roles in “Interstellar” and “A Most Violent Year.” It’s well-known by now that he was a major force in getting “Selma” made after several abortive attempts. But as he told the Bagger in this video, he was halfway to gaining the extra 30 pounds he needed to play the part of the civil rights leader when one of those efforts was abandoned.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: David Oyelowo Talks ‘Selma’ and ‘Overnight’ Success', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oyelowo, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-14T17:19:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d3f5740-50de-5526-96ec-dc62a44e0534', 'word_count': 107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d3f5740-50de-5526-96ec-dc62a44e0534'}, {'abstract': 'The officials sent a letter to the bank seeking more details about the nature of the breach, which potentially exposed some information for 83 million consumers and small businesses.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/14/state-attorneys-general-press-jpmorgan-chase-for-more-details-on-hacking/', 'snippet': 'The officials sent a letter to the bank seeking more details about the nature of the breach, which potentially exposed some information for 83 million consumers and small businesses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A group of state attorneys general who are investigating a computer systems breach last summer at JPMo