 felt this morning. The worst fears are confirmed with regard to the town of Avezzano and the surrounding district. As far as can be at present ascertained, only 800 inhabitants out of a population of 11,000 have escaped and the majority of these are injured. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 15, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-articleLarge.png', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-jumbo.png', 'height': 508, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-superJumbo.png', 'height': 508, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/blogs/15-iht-retrospective-italy/15-iht-retrospective-italy-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width'