f Medicine urged sponsors of clinical trials to share data.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/business/johnson-johnson-to-make-clinical-data-available-to-outside-researchers.html', 'snippet': 'The health care giant, collaborating with Yale, made the announcement on the same day that the Institute of Medicine urged sponsors of clinical trials to share data.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The health care giant Johnson & Johnson has agreed to make detailed clinical trial data on its medical devices and diagnostic tests available to outside researchers through a collaboration with Yale University, making it the first large device manufacturer to systematically make such data public.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/business/15DEVICE/15DEVICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/15/business/15DEVICE/15DEVICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 506}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/business/15DEVICE/15DEVICE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/business/15DEVICE/15DEVICE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1727, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/15/business/15DEVICE/15DEVICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/15/business/15DEVICE/15DEVICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei