/14/french-halls-architect-shuns-opening-calling-it-premature/', 'snippet': 'Jean Nouvel protests opening of his hall, saying it is not ready yet', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paris – Hours before the official inauguration of the Philharmonie de Paris concert hall on Wednesday, its architect, Jean Nouvel, declared his intention to boycott the gala because he said the towering, 386 million euro (about $455 million) building is not ready to open. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'French Hall’s Architect Shuns Opening,  Calling it Premature', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Architect Is Boycotting Opening of His Building', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nouvel, Jean', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philharmonie de Paris', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-14T18:15:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Doreen Carvajal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Doreen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carvajal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6debbaf3-e720-599e-b9f3-5d55fa9150e1', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6debbaf3-e720-599e-b9f3-5d55fa9150e1'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Schwarz will be awarded the $200,000 prize, which recognizes classic architecture in modern society.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/14/driehaus-prize-for-architecture-goes-to-david-m-schwarz/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Schwarz will be awarded the $200,000 prize, which recognizes classic architecture in modern society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2015 Ri