y Gandelsman’s show at Bargemusic bore the fruits of a 2013 performance of the Chaconne from the second Partita, which he played on gut strings with a Baroque bow.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/arts/johnny-gandelsman-performs-bach-violin-works-at-bargemusic.html', 'snippet': 'Johnny Gandelsman’s show at Bargemusic bore the fruits of a 2013 performance of the Chaconne from the second Partita, which he played on gut strings with a Baroque bow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not every career has a watershed moment. But the violinist Johnny Gandelsman, who gave a mesmerizing performance of Bach’s sonatas and partitas for unaccompanied violin at Bargemusic on Saturday, recalled the pivotal experience that forever changed his approach to this music.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tapping the Past for Fresh Sounds', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tapping the Past for Fresh Sounds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'da Fonseca-Wollheim, Corinna', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bargemusic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gandelsman, Johnny', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-14T22:02:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corinna da Fonseca-Wollheim', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f588e751-575a-5a3e-8c4f-fcbd1bad5e38', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f588e751-575a-5a3e-8c4f-fcbd1bad5e38'}, {