of players from New York City and Las Vegas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Dec. 30, the final day of the Edgar Kaplan Winter Regional in Manhattan, the Truscott Board-a-Match Teams was won by Jared Lilienstein, Michael Polowan and Sam Lev of New York City, and Ron Smith of Las Vegas. They finished more than three boards ahead of Melanie Tucker, Radu Nistor and John Hurd of New York City, and John Kranyak of Las Vegas. Third were Dori Byrnes of Morris Plains, N.J.; Michael Kopera and Craig Ganzer of New York City; William Ehlers of Livingston, N.J.; and Robert Brady of McLean, Va.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Undetected Defense at Edgar Kaplan Winter Regional ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-14T23:18:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9eba643c-96ae-5f57-ae90-403d31d21952', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9eba643c-96ae-5f57-ae90-403d31d21952'}, {'abstract': 'A bodybuilder becomes a male model, and a hunchback holds a woman hostage at his castle in this effects-laden romance-adventure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/movies/i-a-tamil-film-by-shankar-starring-vikram.html', 'snippet': 'A bodybuilder becomes a male model, and a hunchback holds a woman hostage at his castle in this effects-laden romance-adventure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I', 'pri