, 'snippet': 'While many Muslims were upset by the caricatures of Muhammad in Charlie Hebdo, the origins of their objection to visual depictions of the prophet and holy persons of any faith are far from clear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many Muslims upset by the caricatures of the Prophet Muhammad published in Charlie Hebdo, the French satirical newspaper, argue that the issue is not free speech but the insult to a religious figure revered by roughly a quarter of the world’s population.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Attack Raises Questions on Roots of Muslim Objection to Image-Making', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Attack Raises Questions on Roots of Muslim Objection to Image-Making', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlie Hebdo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shariah (Islamic Law)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T03:01:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/860861c3-5abb-5307-bd21-9945599adef8', 'word_count': 787, 'uri': 'nyt://article/860861c3-5abb-5307-bd21-9945599adef8'}, {'abstract': 'Moshe Orlansky, a former doughnut maker at Donut Delite Baking and Processing Company, faced surprising bills after a medical crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/nyregion/a-business-collapse-froze-his-income-and-then-the-pharmacy-bills-came.html', 'snippet': 'Moshe Orlansky, a former d