nytimes.com/2015/01/15/arts/television/whats-on-tv-thursday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '10:15 P.M. (TMC) IN THE NAME OF THE FATHER (1993) Daniel Day-Lewis and Pete Postlethwaite star in Jim Sheridan’s adaptation of “Proved Innocent,” Gerry Conlon’s memoir about an Irishman whose coerced confession for an Irish Republican Army bombing he didn’t commit imprisons his father as well. Emma Thompson plays the lawyer who tries to free them. Writing in The New York Times, Janet Maslin called the film, which was nominated for seven Oscars, “scathingly brilliant” and Mr. Day-Lewis’s performance “dazzling.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Thursday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Thursday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T06:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/9adf3f9d-349d-5cc5-a934-2886a65533d0', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9adf3f9d-349d-5cc5-a934-2886a65533d0'}, {'abstract': 'While automakers show off new cars at the Cobo Center this week, plenty of classics can be found abandoned around the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/01/15/automobiles/20150115detroit-nytnow.html', 'snippet': 'While automakers show off new cars at the Cobo Center this week, plenty of classics can be found abandoned around the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While automakers show off new cars at the Cobo Center this w