'value': 'Gilroy, Dan (1959- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Inarritu, Alejandro G', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolie, Angelina', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Linklater, Richard', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nolan, Christopher', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Redmayne, Eddie', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T11:30:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply and Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a510a535-8ba8-5c0d-8db0-4cfc37c88bbc', 'word_count': 1441, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a510a535-8ba8-5c0d-8db0-4cfc37c88bbc'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: it was Moving Day in Paris in 1890.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/1890-moving-day-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: it was Moving Day in Paris in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': ' PARIS — The highways and byeways of the metropolis were disfigured yesterday from dawn till dark with countless furniture vans, which, laden down and creaking under the weight of beds, boxes, book cases, chairs, stoves, carpets, tables and all the thousand and one things which go to make up a home, crawled along with cracking whips and swearing drivers, bringing the penates of many an unsettled family to some new abiding place. It was the fifteenth of January, dreaded day when grinding landlords and landladies insist on having their quarter’s rent. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 16, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/blogs/16iht-oldjan16-paris/16iht-oldjan16-paris-jumbo.png', 'height': 394, 'width': 280, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/blogs/16iht-oldjan16-paris/16iht-oldjan16-paris-superJumbo.png', 'height': 394, 'width': 280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/blogs/16iht-oldjan16-paris/16iht-oldjan16-paris-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/16/blogs/16iht-oldjan16-paris/16iht-oldjan16-paris-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/blogs/16iht-oldjan16-paris/16iht-oldjan16-paris-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Moving Day in Paris', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T11:30:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization