t-of-turkish-citizens-arrests.html', 'snippet': 'The Turkish Foreign Ministry confirmed that 10 Turks were under arrest in China but did not say they had been helping terrorism suspects, as a Chinese report asserted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — The Turkish Foreign Ministry has confirmed that 10 Turkish citizens are under arrest in China on charges of trying to smuggle people out of the country, but it did not say they had been helping terrorism suspects, as a Chinese news report asserted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkey Casts Doubt on Chinese Account of Turks’ Arrests in Smuggling Plot', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China: Turkey Confirms Arrests in Smuggling Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arsu, Sebnem', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Xinjiang (China)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uighurs (Chinese Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Global Times', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T15:37:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Wong and Sebnem Arsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Sebnem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'repor