 the hours after the Academy made its announcement.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/oscar-nominations-2015-oscarssowhite-emerges-as-response/', 'snippet': 'Twitter users responded to a lack of Oscar nominees of color with a hashtag that was used thousands of times in the hours after the Academy made its announcement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2015 Oscars nominations did not recognize any actors of color, nor did the\xa0director Ava DuVernay receive a nod for her work on “Selma” (which is up for best\xa0picture). And the omissions were widely noted online.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oscar Nominations 2015: #OscarsSoWhite Emerges as Response', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T16:06:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Roston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/780cde3e-7c51-555f-9c73-f5147ffede78', 'word_count': 278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/780cde3e-7c51-555f-9c73-f5147ffede78'}, {'abstract': 'The report said that demand for crude would fall to 28.8 million barrels per day this year, 100,000 barrels a day less than it forecast last month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/16/business/opec-report-downgrades-demand-for-oil.html', 'snippet': 'The report said that demand for crude would fall to 28.8 million barrels per day this year, 100,000 barrels a day less than it forecast last month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The Organization of the Petroleum Exporting Countries issued a report on Thursday that downgraded demand for its crude for 2015, while also predicting slower oil-producti