ri': 'nyt://slideshow/52cc2c68-1e04-56cd-a813-9fa9a81c3132'}, {'abstract': 'Banks are blaming market ups and downs for hurting earnings. That’s rich after years of claiming conditions were too docile, writes Antony Currie of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/15/volatility-is-the-new-weather-for-banks/', 'snippet': 'Banks are blaming market ups and downs for hurting earnings. That’s rich after years of claiming conditions were too docile, writes Antony Currie of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Volatility is the new weather for the likes of Citigroup and Bank of America. The two mega-banks joined JPMorgan Chase in blaming market ups and downs for crimping trading revenue and thus hurting overall earnings. That’s rich after years of claiming conditions were too docile. It doesn’t mask the deeper problem the lenders have, either.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/25/business/dbpix-citi3/dbpix-citi2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Volatility Is the New Weather for Banks', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citigroup Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T20:58:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Antony Currie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Antony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Currie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10010aa5-9882-508f-9482-3f184f28b269', 'word_count': 415, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10010aa5-9882-508f-9482-3f184f28b269'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Morimura slyly inserts himself into Velázquez’s “Las Meninas,” among other Western masterpieces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/16/arts/design/yasumasa-morimura.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Morimura slyly inserts himself into Velázquez’s “Las Meninas,” among other Western masterpieces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sly re-enactor of art history Yasumasa Morimura is back with yet another of his witty, gender-bending attacks on Western masterpieces, and this time he’s set his sights inadvisably high. His target is Velázquez’s “Las Meninas,” one of the most famous paintings and a work already rich in intrigue and charisma. Fortunately, Mr. Morimura rises to the occasion with photographs that tease out the painting’s spatial layers and strange mirror effects (while playing his usual games with identity).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 720}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 854, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1653, 'width': 1377, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2/16YASUMASA-GALLERY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16YASUMASA-GALLERY