s “Paddington.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/16/movies/paddington-an-adaptation-of-michael-bonds-books.html', 'snippet': 'The beloved bear of children’s books makes his big-screen debut in Paul King’s “Paddington.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In stark contrast to their furry, blundering star, the makers of “Paddington” have colored so carefully inside the lines that any possibility of surprise or subversion is effectively throttled. Perhaps burdened by an excess of respect for Paddington Bear’s creator, the children’s author Michael Bond, or maybe just unwilling to deter the built-in market for the inevitable movie-related merchandising, the filmmakers have settled on safe.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16PADDINGTON/PADDINGTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 297, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16PADDINGTON/PADDINGTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 297}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16PADDINGTON/PADDINGTON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 507, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16PADDINGTON/PADDINGTON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 1712, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16PADDINGTON/16PADDINGTON-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16PADDINGTON/16PADDINGTON-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwid