you collect an inheritance of table and chairs, you realize it’s to help you stay connected to friends.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are 16 chairs in the one-room apartment I share with my girlfriend, and 18 if you count the tiny ones my young daughters favor when drawing at the coffee table. We also have a love seat and an enormous sectional sofa — a crazy amount of seating for an abode with only one private space, the bathroom (just one seat in there, and it’s porcelain). Jessica, my girlfriend, jokingly calls our apartment “the chair emporium.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/fashion/18MODERNLOVE/18MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How I Came to Live in a Chair Emporium', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Table Set for the Past and the Future', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mountford, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Friendship', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-15T22:48:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Mountford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mountford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8e128fa-1176-5a85-9198-d3f64a129c50', 'word_count': 1514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8e128fa-1176-5a85-9198-d3f64a129c50'}, {'abstract': 'Answering questions of marital infidelity, wigs for a teenager, proper idioms and bathroom protocol.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/18/fashion/social-qs-put-a-lid-on-it.html', 'snippet': 'Answering questions of marital infidelity, wigs for a teenager, proper idioms and bathroom protocol.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I am ashamed to admit that I have cheated on my wife several times during our 10-year marriage. So far, she has not found out. Every time, I vow it will be the last time, but it never is. And opportunities for cheating keep presenting themselves. My wife nearly discovered my last affair, which I ended before the holidays. This makes me worry that I am growing careless. You are an odd place to turn for help, but I trust your advice, and my wife loves your column. What should I do?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Road to Nowhere', 'kicker': 'Social Q’s', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline'