tract': '“Appropriate Behavior” centers on a willful young bisexual woman in Brooklyn who embarks erratically on sexual adventures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/16/movies/desiree-akhavans-appropriate-behavior.html', 'snippet': '“Appropriate Behavior” centers on a willful young bisexual woman in Brooklyn who embarks erratically on sexual adventures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Because “Appropriate Behavior” is set in Brooklyn and focuses on the romantic confusion and misadventures of Shirin, a headstrong young Iranian-American woman adrift in hipsterland, this lively romantic comedy starring Desiree Akhavan, who wrote and directed, has inevitably been compared to “Girls.” Shirin’s brash, off-kilter attitude is not unlike that of Lena Dunham’s Hannah Horvath. Both are self-centered, impulsive and brusque. But there are few signs that Shirin possesses Hannah’s driving career ambition. When Shirin takes a job teaching filmmaking to kindergartners, the little tykes run her ragged. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16APPROPIATE/APPROPIATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16APPROPIATE/APPROPIATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16APPROPIATE/APPROPIATE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/16/arts/16APPROPIATE/APPROPIATE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1049, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': N