e chokehold is still the “first act of physical force” that officers use, even facing “mere verbal confrontation.” To better understand the methods that the Police Department uses to subdue suspects, Kirk Semple, a reporter, was asked to experience them firsthand. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Experiencing the Chokehold Firsthand', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Eric', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santora, Marc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-16T17:17:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ceab22a-6216-5123-a307-1750fb2ea4ba', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ceab22a-6216-5123-a307-1750fb2ea4ba'}, {'abstract': 'Restaurants try to find ways to brag about nutrition while also bragging about portion size. Behold the “culinary monsterpiece.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/17/upshot/letter-from-the-editor-calories-a-two-step.html', 'snippet': 'Restaurants try to find ways to brag about nutrition while also bragging about portion size. Behold the “culinary monsterpiece.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s fair to say that the pe