'nyt://article/55fe751b-3d26-5b7f-b81d-53fc8e4c75ff'}, {'abstract': 'The Tom Hanks Op-Ed “I Owe It All to Community College” evoked readers’ youthful hopes —\xa0and their support of community colleges.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/16/readers-respond-on-tom-hanks-and-community-college/', 'snippet': 'The Tom Hanks Op-Ed “I Owe It All to Community College” evoked readers’ youthful hopes —\xa0and their support of community colleges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like the boy who looked into a “magic” machine and wished to be “Big,” the actor and director Tom Hanks evoked readers’ youthful hopes as they recounted how they realized their ambitions through inexpensive community colleges like the one he attended in the 1970s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/17/opinion/nyto-hanks/nyto-hanks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/17/opinion/nyto-hanks/nyto-hanks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/17/opinion/nyto-hanks/nyto-hanks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1013, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/17/opinion/nyto-hanks/nyto-hanks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1999, 'width': 2020, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/17/opinion/nyto-hanks/nyto-hanks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/17/opinion/nyto-hanks/nyto-hanks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thu