ightforward to the listener. That category includes Dvorak’s Piano Concerto in G minor, which the British pianist Stephen Hough has described as “a concerto for 10 thumbs,” alluding to the composer’s unidiomatic writing. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Where Dvorak Puts Fleet Fingers to the Ultimate Test', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Where Dvorak Puts Fleet Fingers to the Ultimate Test', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schweitzer, Vivien', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Hall', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Orchestra of St Luke's", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-16T22:37:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivien Schweitzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schweitzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6824c1ad-f97b-51d0-bd9b-fa10789896f3', 'word_count': 333, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6824c1ad-f97b-51d0-bd9b-fa10789896f3'}, {'abstract': 'The main pair event was won by Alan Lechner and Elliot Sternlicht of New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/17/crosswords/bridge/a-deal-from-the-edgar-kaplan-winter-regional.html', 'snippet': 'The main pair event was won by Alan Lechner and Elliot Sternlicht of New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Dec. 27, the second day of the Edgar Kaplan Winter Regional in Manhattan, the main pair event was won by Alan Lechner and Elliot Sternlicht of New York City. 