 'You can hear the chaotic soundtrack of Zerega even before you enter the building: the ping and thwock of rubber balls hitting cement walls, the distinctive squeak of sneakers stopping short on painted floors, and the ohhhhhhs that accompany the echo of a particularly good shot. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Bronx, Paddle Ball All (Thwock!) Winter Long', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Paddle Ball All (Thwock!) Winter Long', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Zerega Indoor Paddleball/Handball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Handball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-17T00:12:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gloria Dawson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gloria', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dawson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8aac666-cb34-50bf-8455-5f5b8eadab09', 'word_count': 610, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8aac666-cb34-50bf-8455-5f5b8eadab09'}, {'abstract': 'Tony Robbins’s best-selling new book speaks highly of a certain type of annuity, but there may be less there than meets the eye.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/17/your-money/slippery-tips-on-annuities-from-a-life-coach.html', 'snippet': 'Tony Robbins’s best-selling new book speaks highly of a certain type of annuity, but there may be less there than meets the eye.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By Page 418 of Tony Robbins’s new book “Money: Master the Game,” which promises on the cover that its seven steps to financial freedom will be “simple,” I was sort of ready to put it down.', 'print_section