896b-fefb-58a2-91f8-abcdb0bc029b'}, {'abstract': 'He fought for justice on behalf of four churchwomen who were abducted, raped and murdered in El Salvador.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/18/world/americas/robert-e-white-ex-ambassador-to-latin-america-dies-at-88.html', 'snippet': 'He fought for justice on behalf of four churchwomen who were abducted, raped and murdered in El Salvador.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Dec. 1, 1980, two churchwomen, Jean Donovan and Sister Dorothy Kazel, spent the night at the American Embassy in San Salvador as guests of Ambassador Robert E. White and his wife. The next day, the two women and two other nuns, all crusaders for human rights, were abducted, raped and murdered. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/world/dog-white-obit/dog-white-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/18/world/dog-white-obit/dog-white-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 808}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/world/dog-white-obit/dog-white-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 761, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/world/dog-white-obit/dog-white-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1522, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/world/dog-white-obit/dog-white-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/18/world/d