ON — The first page of a petition seeking Supreme Court review is the most important. It sets out the “question presented,” the one the court will answer if it takes the case. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taking Up Gay Marriage, but on Its Own Terms', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taking Up Gay Marriage, but on Their Own Terms', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-17T15:13:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce2d13d5-82bb-5e0c-a326-576085817ddf', 'word_count': 830, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce2d13d5-82bb-5e0c-a326-576085817ddf'}, {'abstract': 'Memo is an app that wants to elevate water-cooler talk so that the good ideas and criticism of company practices are accessible to everyone in the company. It is an anonymous message board within specific workplaces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/18/nyregion/an-app-memo-for-anonymous-discussion-of-a-company.html', 'snippet': 'Memo is an app that wants to elevate water-cooler talk so that the good ideas and criticism of company practices are accessible to everyone in the company. It is an anonymous message board within specific workplaces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ryan Janssen, the founder of a new app called Memo, comes across as an idealist. He maintains that t