. Still, the Hawks are the hottest team in the league; entering Saturday, they were 32-8, had won 25 of their last 27 games and led the Eastern Conference by five games.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 819, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1638, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/18/sports/subdogHAWKS/subdogHAWKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Unselfish Hawks Resemble Winners, Namely, the Spurs', 'kicker': 'Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unselfish Hawks Resemble Winners, Namely, the Spurs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mason, Beckley', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Budenholzer, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Korver, Kyle', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Popovich, Gregg', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teague, Jeff', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Antonio Spurs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Hawks', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-17T20:46:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Beckley Mason', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Beckley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mason', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf103887-3543-570b-91b3-2422061c1e28', 'word_count': 920, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf103887-3543-570b-91b3-2422061c1e28'}, {'abstract': 'Charley Rosen, who has known Phil Jackson for 40 years, recently published a book about the 1972-73 Philadelphia 76ers, who went 9-73.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/18/sports/basketball/phil-jackson-confidant-studies-historically-bad-teams-like-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'Charley Rosen, who has known Phil Jackson for 40 years, recently published a book about the 1972-73 Philadelphia 76ers, who went 9-73.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over 40 years, Phil Jackson and Charley Rosen have coached and written books together, played hundreds of games of one-on-one, and discussed basketball philosophy as if Descartes equaled Holzman.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur