ful eight-game run this season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/19/sports/football/cbs-renews-thursday-night-football-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The network will carry the first eight Thursday night games of the 2015 season after a successful eight-game run this season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CBS announced Sunday that it would carry Thursday night football games again in 2015, building on the games’ success during the 2014 season.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CBS Renews Its Thursday Football Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'CBS Renews Its Thursday Football Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Sports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-18T22:48:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b473ff7e-ad49-5f58-bcba-51a938c7ed6b', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b473ff7e-ad49-5f58-bcba-51a938c7ed6b'}, {'abstract': 'The big weekend totals by “American Sniper” give the Oscars the breakout hit that awards show was lacking in the best picture category.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/19/movies/sniper-rules-weekend-box-office.html', 'snippet': 'The big weekend totals by “American Sniper” give the Oscars the breakout hit that awards show was lacking in the best picture catego