61fff2bef'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Danza sings a musical number — and does some tap dancing — from the new Broadway musical, with the show’s composer, Jason Robert Brown, on piano.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/20/in-performance-tony-danza-and-jason-robert-brown-of-honeymoon-in-vegas/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Danza sings a musical number — and does some tap dancing — from the new Broadway musical, with the show’s composer, Jason Robert Brown, on piano.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s video, Tony Danza sings the number “A Little Luck” from the new Broadway musical “Honeymoon in Vegas,” based on the 1992 film. The show’s composer, Jason Robert Brown, accompanies him on piano. And in a first for this series, Mr. Danza, who plays a high-stakes gambler in the show, performs some crackerjack tap dancing. “Honeymoon in Vegas,” directed by Gary Griffin, is at the Nederlander Theater.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Tony Danza and Jason Robert Brown of ‘Honeymoon in Vegas’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Jason Robert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Danza, Tony', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-20T13:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb5b11af-fee9-5d56-8707-e79c060e66fb', 'word_count': 124, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb5b11af-fee9-5d56-8707-e79c060e66fb'}, {'abstract': 'An extra-large helping of lapses.', 'web_url': 'https://afterdeadline.