79f3-551a-958f-e53b0a0d4cd7'}, {'abstract': 'The prosecutors’ office in Krakow says a request by the United States for the extradition of the director Roman Polanski can proceed.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/20/prosecutors-in-poland-send-polanski-extradition-request-to-court/', 'snippet': 'The prosecutors’ office in Krakow says a request by the United States for the extradition of the director Roman Polanski can proceed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WARSAW — Polish prosecutors on Tuesday forwarded a\xa0request for the extradition of the director Roman Polanski\xa0to the United States, over a 1977 conviction for having sex with a 13-year-old girl, to the district court in Krakow. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prosecutors in Poland Send Polanski Extradition Request to Court', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Extradition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Polanski, Roman', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poland', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-20T16:28:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By JOANNA BERENDT', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'BERENDT', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/296e9f21-b7cd-5bb2-b075-66638fbb5031', 'word_count': 201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/296e9f21-b7cd-5bb2-b075-66638fbb5031'}, {'abstract': 'The subject matter on the artist’s new LP is inspired by werewolves, the moons of Jupiter and Name’s own cancer diagnosis and treatment.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/20/jack-name-new-album-los-angeles-musician/', 'snippet': 'The subject matter on the artist’s new LP is inspired by werewolves, the moons of Jupiter and Name’s own cancer diagnosis and treatment.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Maybe it’s a strange thing to be a concept album person, but it’s just the way my brain works. I like long, epic, ridiculous things,” says the Los Angeles-based musician Jack Name, a former member of the cult-favorite San Francisco psychedelic band White Fence whose latest LP, “Weird Moons,” is out today via Castle Face Records. On his last record, 2014’s “Light Show,” Name revealed a twisted battle between light and shadows, the subtext of which was a criticism of the use of prescription drugs to suppress children’s creativity. The concept of “Weird Moons” is even more eccentric: a posthumous space trip in which the album’s protagonists transform into werewolves and then shape-shift depending on their proximity to each of Jupiter’s 67 moons.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 799}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1773, 'width': 1331, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/t-magazine/20name-comingore/20name-comingore-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Epic, Space-Bound New Album from the L.A. Musician Jack Name', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jupiter (Planet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-20T16:30:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aly Comingore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aly', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Comingore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35e67184-f625-54bd-8681-35dc04fbb484', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35e67184-f625-54bd-8681-35dc04fbb484'}, {'abstract': 'From the moment we met our daughter, weighing two-and-a-half pounds and wearing a red bow pasted on her head, we could tell she was the fighter and “rock star” we’d been told about.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/20/meeting-the-baby-becoming-a-family/', 'snippet': 'From the moment we met our daughter, weighing two-and-a-half pounds and wearing a red bow pasted on her head, we could tell she was the fighter and “rock star” we’d been told about.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve never been a big believer in “signs from above” or cosmic signals or any of that flimflam. But the package I saw on my doorstep on Jan. 6 gave me pause: a free sample of Enfamil formula.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 910, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 910, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/us/motherlode-evy1/motherlode-evy1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Meeting the Baby, Becoming a Family', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo'