, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84b2f92d-0e7c-5292-9cd2-ad04e7884efd', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84b2f92d-0e7c-5292-9cd2-ad04e7884efd'}, {'abstract': 'There is even less suspense about this year’s address than usual. But here’s what we’d like to hear.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/20/the-editorial-boards-state-of-the-union-wish-list/', 'snippet': 'There is even less suspense about this year’s address than usual. But here’s what we’d like to hear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is even less suspense about this year’s State of the Union than usual. The White House has been frantically briefing news organizations about the proposals President Obama is going to make tonight – and in any case it’s extremely likely (perhaps certain?) that his entire agenda will be dead on arrival in the Republican-controlled Congress. Sometimes I think that if Mr. Obama proposed repealing the Affordable Care Act the Republicans would reflexively reject him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/opinion/1202015wishlist/1202015wishlist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/20/opinion/1202015wishlist/1202015wishlist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/opinion/1202015wishlist/1202015wishlist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/20/opinion/1202015wishlist/1202015wishlist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'su