 and war crimes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A notorious Ugandan rebel commander accused of kidnapping children and planning massacres is on his way to face charges of crimes against humanity at the International Criminal Court in The Hague, court officials announced Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'L.R.A. Commander Ongwen Heads to Face Charges in Hague', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Lord's Resistance Army", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Criminal Court', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ongwen, Dominic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uganda', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-20T20:23:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51240101-e419-5ea0-8e7d-790424703581', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51240101-e419-5ea0-8e7d-790424703581'}, {'abstract': 'My pregnancy’s viability is still very much in limbo. As am I. I am readying myself for whatever happens, but I am split in a way I have never felt before.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/20/43-and-pregnant/', 'snippet': 'My pregnancy’s viability is still very much in limbo. As am I. I am readying myself for whatever happens, but I am split in a way I have never felt before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was interrupted midthought, midword, midbreath. In that moment