'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06714ea0-50e9-5eaa-ae7b-7a8f763d8dff', 'word_count': 1479, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06714ea0-50e9-5eaa-ae7b-7a8f763d8dff'}, {'abstract': 'To hear President Obama tell it to Congress on Tuesday, the economy is “roaring back.” That’s true in some places; in others it is more of a putter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/us/obama-state-of-the-union-economy-reaction.html', 'snippet': 'To hear President Obama tell it to Congress on Tuesday, the economy is “roaring back.” That’s true in some places; in others it is more of a putter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The economy President Obama described Tuesday night during his State of the Union address sounded pretty good — with unemployment down and jobs added at the fastest past since 1999.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/us/VIEWS-web2/VIEWS-web2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/22/us/VIEWS-web2/VIEWS-web2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/us/VIEWS-web2/VIEWS-web2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/us/VIEWS-web2/VIEWS-web2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/us/VIEWS-web2/VIEWS-web2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20