ops, a chief spokesman for the Ukrainian military said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/world/22ukraine-span/22ukraine-span-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Battle Rages With Rebels at Border Post in Ukraine', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Battle Rages With Rebels at Border Post in Ukraine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lyman, Rick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Donetsk (Ukraine)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Donetsk International Airport (Ukraine)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poroshenko, Petro Olekseyevich', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lavrov, Sergey V', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moscow (Russia)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-21T17:32:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Lyman and Andrew E. Kramer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Kramer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4dcc55f-7339-5102-b146-bd1d02c2a0ce', 'word_count': 888, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4dcc55f-7339-5102-b146-bd1d02c2a0ce'}, {'abstract': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/21/classical-playlist-puccini-mendelssohn-wagner-and-more/', 'snippet': 'Times critics share what they’ve been listening to lately.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PUCCINI: ‘Turandot’ Joan Sutherland, soprano; Luciano Pavarotti, tenor; Montserrat Caballé, soprano; Zubin Mehta, conductor; London Philharmonic Orchestra(Decca 478 7815; two CDs)Full disclosure: I am no audiophile. I’m still catching up with Blu-ray as a video technology. But now Decca has issued some classic opera recordings from its catalog remastered from the original tapes in what is called Blu-ray Pure Audio. I’m loath to apply the word “pure” to anything. Still, listening to this reissue of the landmark 1972 recording of Puccini’s “Turandot,” with the dynamic Zubin Mehta conducting the London Philharmonic Orchestra and a dream cast headed by Joan Sutherland and Luciano Pavarotti, I have to say the sound quality is clean, vivid and strikingly detailed. Ms. Sutherland, the reigning bel canto soprano of her day, was tempted into the studio to sing Turandot, a vocally weighty role she never performed in a house. Her voice is gleaming and penetrating, and Mr. Mehta draws surprising intensity from an artist who could be stolid. Mr. Pavarotti is in his prime as Calaf. With the sumptuous Montserrat Caballé as Liù, Nicolai Ghiaurov as Timur and, of all people, Peter Pears as the old emperor, this is quite the cast. (Anthony Tommasini)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/classical/classical-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/classical/classical-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/classical/classical-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/classical/classical-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/classical/classical-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name'