 season opening performance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/arts/dance/new-york-city-ballet-performs-george-balanchine-classics.html', 'snippet': 'George Balanchine’s interplay between self and selflessness is on display in the New York City Ballet’s winter season opening performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the curtain rises on George Balanchine’s “Serenade,” we’re plunged into a drama about selflessness. Seventeen young women are all facing front, all dressed alike, all slowly going through a ritual that strikingly resembles that of religious devotees. In what follows — as we watch loners; connections between individuals; kernel-like groups of three, four and five; and suggestions of love, loss, consolation and transcendence — we constantly see how lives are absorbed in something larger than private concerns.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/dance/NYCB/NYCB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/dance/NYCB/NYCB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/dance/NYCB/NYCB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/dance/NYCB/NYCB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1472, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/arts/dance/NYCB/NYCB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy