ial network is adding a feature called Recap that will show its users three top messages they missed since they last logged onto the service.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/21/twitter-now-helps-you-catch-up-on-missed-tweets/', 'snippet': 'The social network is adding a feature called Recap that will show its users three top messages they missed since they last logged onto the service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twitter prides itself on being a real-time information service. If something big is going on right now, more and more people will post messages about it, and eventually the news will find its way into your Twitter feed.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/21/technology/21bits-twitter/21bits-twitter-articleLarge.png', 'height': 1226, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/21/technology/21bits-twitter/21bits-twitter-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1226}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/21/technology/21bits-twitter/21bits-twitter-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 501, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/21/technology/21bits-twitter/21bits-twitter-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1670, 'width': 817, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/21/technology/21bits-twitter/21bits-twitter-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/21/technology/21bits-twitter/21bits-twitter-thumbStandar