and-obama-goes-all-out.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s self-assured State of the Union address Tuesday reflected his sense of being liberated and emboldened, White House aides said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The morning after major Democratic losses in last year’s midterm elections, President Obama walked into the Roosevelt Room with a message for his despondent staff: I’m not done yet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gloom Lifts, and Obama Goes All Out', 'kicker': 'White House Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Political Gloom Lifting, an Ebullient Obama Goes for Broke', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the Union Message (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T02:43:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/353dbfe1-e2b0-5cf5-a9ea-86e2298d40af', 'word_count': 1021, 'uri': 'nyt://article/353dbfe1-e2b0-5cf5-a9ea-86e2298d40af'}, {'abstract': 'Its front page, posted online along with a preview of the topless woman, corrected other outlets’ reports that the paper was ending the feature.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/business/topless-photos-return-at-the-sun-tabloids-page-3.html', 'snippet': 'Its front page, posted online along with a preview of the topless woman, corrected other outlets’ reports that the paper was ending the feature.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The news swept the world, applauded as a sign of progress. After 40 years Britain’s Sun newspaper, according to news reports this week, would stop running photographs of topless women on its Page 3.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Topless Photos Return to Page 3 of\xa0Britain’s Sun Tabloid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain: Tabloid Has ‘Mammary Lapse’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sun, The (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nudism and Nudity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T02:58:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/37106aab-4178-5af5-9e41-3a0ba31a98eb', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37106aab-4178-5af5-9e41-3a0ba31a98eb'}, {'abstract': 'A Timothy Polin puzzle that’s of solid construction.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/21/decoder-ring-for-short/', 'snippet': 'A Timothy Polin puzzle that’s of solid construction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THURSDAY — We’re building columns today, but they’re not the kind that hold up buildings. Timothy Polin is back, and he has h