 market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/nyregion/man-wrote-of-creating-illicit-site-jury-is-told.html', 'snippet': 'Reading from what they say is his diary, prosecutors in Federal District Court highlighted Ross W. Ulbricht’s ideas for starting and expanding the online black market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Long before the website Silk Road became an online black market for drugs and other illicit goods, it began its life of underground commerce with the sale of homegrown hallucinogenic mushrooms, prosecutors have said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Journal, Man Wrote of Creating Silk Road, an Online Black Market, Prosecutors Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Wrote of Creating Illicit Site, Jury Is Told', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ulbricht, Ross William', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Markets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberattacks and Hackers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Silk Road 2.0', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T03:18:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/426714de-6e8f-5598-98bf-78cdb9c7c739', 'word_count': 733, 'uri': 'nyt://article/426714de-6e8f-5598-98bf-78cdb9c7c739'}, {'abstract': 'Flames from the blaze at Avalon at Edgewater in New Jersey could be seen ac