l', 'snippet': 'Before the Army-Navy football game of 1963, Mr. Verna, the inventor of instant replay, puzzled out a method to rewind videotape and immediately run it again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Army-Navy game of 1963 was an important one in that season’s college football landscape. With a Heisman Trophy winner and future pro star at quarterback, Roger Staubach, Navy, the No. 2 team in the nation, won by 21-15 and went on to face top-ranked Texas in the Cotton Bowl. (Texas won.)', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 597}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1019, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1198, 'width': 1204, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/22/sports/VERNA-1-obit/VERNA-1-obit-thumbLarg