 the United States attorney for the Southern District of New York, said Mr. Silver had produced “a nice profit on being a public official.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/nyregion/speaker-of-new-york-assembly-sheldon-silver-is-arrested-in-corruption-case.html', 'snippet': 'Preet Bharara, the United States attorney for the Southern District of New York, said Mr. Silver had produced “a nice profit on being a public official.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sheldon Silver, the speaker of the New York Assembly, exploited his position as one of the most powerful politicians in the state to obtain millions of dollars in bribes and kickbacks, federal authorities said on Thursday as they announced his arrest on a sweeping series of corruption charges.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/nyregion/23silver3/23silver3-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sheldon Silver, Assembly Speaker, Took Millions in Payoffs, U.S. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Says Assembly Speaker Took Millions in Payoffs, Abusing Office', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Sheldon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bharara, Preet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T13:17:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By William K. Rashbaum and Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Rashbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/777b3dd6-6e3a-5ca0-8037-8b5398743e25', 'word_count': 1465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/777b3dd6-6e3a-5ca0-8037-8b5398743e25'}, {'abstract': 'The latest men’s collection from Louis Vuitton at Paris Fashion Week.', 'web_url': 'ht