lue': 'Marks, Michael E (1950- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Polisi, Joseph W', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Juilliard School', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T16:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f1e745a-0625-52b2-9ca1-459b607f4ec0', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f1e745a-0625-52b2-9ca1-459b607f4ec0'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Violent and bloodthirsty speeches were pronounced at the Anarchist Convention in London in 1890.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/1890-violent-speeches-by-anarchists/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Violent and bloodthirsty speeches were pronounced at the Anarchist Convention in London in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON —\xa0An International Convention of Anarchist and Revolutionary delegates was opened in London today at the International Socialist Club, Soho. Some very violent and bloodthirsty speeches were pronounced. Mr. Stone attended to represent the Chicago Anarchists. He was concerned in the riots and murders in that city, and was an intimate friend of the man Parsons, executed for throwing dynamite bombs at the police. He advised the extreme section to turn their attention to the kings of commerce, their banks, exchange bourses and other machinery for oppressing the workers.\xa0— The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 23, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 892}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 689, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1378, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/blogs/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists/23iht-oldjan23-anarchists-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Violent Speeches by Anarchists', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Socialism (Theory and Philosophy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (E