ame': None, 'lastname': 'Beardmore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd211c3c-43e0-5124-9b2b-2a6d3015ffc3', 'word_count': 260, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd211c3c-43e0-5124-9b2b-2a6d3015ffc3'}, {'abstract': 'A specialized group of examiners is set to train its focus on hedge funds and other funds that invest in illiquid products like real estate, timber and energy assets, an S.E.C. official said on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/after-inspecting-private-equity-funds-s-e-c-examiners-to-broaden-focus/', 'snippet': 'A specialized group of examiners is set to train its focus on hedge funds and other funds that invest in illiquid products like real estate, timber and energy assets, an S.E.C. official said on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Officials at the Securities and Exchange Commission have said they discovered numerous problems when examining private equity firms during a two-year review that ended recently.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Inspecting Private Equity Funds, S.E.C. Examiners to Broaden Focus', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T17:20:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', 