 losses risks undermining the eurozone’s foundations. Pierre Briançon of Reuters Breakingviews writes.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/draghis-bond-buying-plan-runs-counter-to-eurozone-principles/', 'snippet': 'The E.C.B.’s bond buying program is big enough to impress markets. But partial nationalization of losses risks undermining the eurozone’s foundations. Pierre Briançon of Reuters Breakingviews writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mario Draghi has compromised on principles for the sake of effectiveness. Mr. Draghi, the European Central Bank’s president, announced on Thursday a long-expected bond buying program that will be huge from the start and last until eurozone inflation gets back on track. But the eurozone’s version of quantitative easing runs contrary to the principles of a currency union.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-draghi/dbpix-draghi-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-draghi/dbpix-draghi-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-draghi/dbpix-draghi-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-draghi/dbpix-draghi-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-draghi/dbpix-draghi-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSta