type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b3bbfea-2cac-5d43-9c41-39acd7bf8cce', 'word_count': 914, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b3bbfea-2cac-5d43-9c41-39acd7bf8cce'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama will not meet with Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel when he travels to Washington in March to address a joint session of Congress.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/us/politics/white-house-citing-israeli-election-says-obama-and-netanhayu-wont-meet.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama will not meet with Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel when he travels to Washington in March to address a joint session of Congress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAWRENCE, Kan. — President Obama will not meet with Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel when he travels to Washington in March to address a joint session of Congress, the White House said on Thursday, citing a policy against receiving foreign leaders close to their elections.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'White House, Citing Israeli Election, Says Obama and Netanyahu Won’t Meet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T19:18:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Hirschfeld Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'Hirschfeld', 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd787146-5827-5577-9980-ee5ee2574bc6', 'word_count': 295, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd787146-5827-5577-9980-ee5ee2574bc6'}, {'abstract': 'A camera used by the Trappist monk and writer Thomas Merton will appear in a centennial exhibition at Columbia University.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/arts/design/a-monks-interests-captured-on-camera.html', 'snippet': 'A camera used by the Trappist monk and writer Thomas Merton will appear in a centennial exhibition at Columbia University.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A forgotten camera said to have been used by the Trappist monk and writer Thomas Merton will appear in public for the first time on Feb. 2 in a Merton centennial exhibition at Columbia University’s Rare Book & Manuscript Library. Merton, who died in 1968, at 53, had taken vows at a Kentucky monastery that decreed he could own few possessions. With borrowed camera equipment, he took about 1,800 photos, creating meditative abstract compositions out of rocks, leaves, wagon wheels and barn siding.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23ANTIQUES1/23ANTIQUES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1074, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23ANTIQUES1/23ANTIQUES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1074}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23ANTIQUES1/23ANTIQUES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23ANTIQUES1/23ANTIQUES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1145, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23