e5'}, {'abstract': 'After a revolt by Republican women on an abortion ban, the House instead passed a bill limiting the use of taxpayer funds to pay for abortions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/us/politics/house-gop-discards-bill-banning-abortion-at-20-weeks-but-passes-another-restriction.html', 'snippet': 'After a revolt by Republican women on an abortion ban, the House instead passed a bill limiting the use of taxpayer funds to pay for abortions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — House Republicans struggled on Thursday to mend another unwelcome rift that threatens to tarnish their party’s image with women and younger voters, shelving a contentious bill to outlaw most abortions after 20 weeks of pregnancy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/23/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ra