al a 26 percent premium that planned cost cuts don’t justify, writes Daniel Indiviglio of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Royal Bank of Canada is placing an expensive bet that the second time’s a charm for a foray south of the border. The Canadian titan is paying $5.4 billion for Beverly Hills-based City National little more than three years after it cut a painful retreat from \xa0retail banking in the United States. This time around, RBC boss David McKay, who took the reins last August, has taken aim at a growing franchise in a coveted part of the market. But he’s also paying through the nose for it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-city-national3/dbpix-city-national3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-city-national3/dbpix-city-national3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-city-national3/dbpix-city-national3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-city-national3/dbpix-city-national3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 999, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-city-national3/dbpix-city-national2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/23/business/dbpix-city-national3/dbpix-city-national2-thumbStandard