rd_count': 282, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6644e9ba-a30e-5d1a-b7bb-6d9f6fb2b3e1'}, {'abstract': 'Dealing with engagement gifts, observant guests, loud landlord and a story about a sister.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/25/style/social-qs-gift-of-good-manners.html', 'snippet': 'Dealing with engagement gifts, observant guests, loud landlord and a story about a sister.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My fiancé and I were recently engaged. His mother gave us a week at her timeshare vacation home as an engagement present because she can’t afford to use it herself. I think this is inappropriate. The burden is on us to make all the other purchases necessary to use the present (flights, ground transport, food). It was clearly a gift of convenience. I want my fiancé to say something to her, but the gift doesn’t bother him. Am I wrong?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'hei