rnful tone, following two murderers, one Japanese and one Indonesian.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/movies/killers-a-slasher-film-by-the-mo-brothers.html', 'snippet': '“Killers,” by the Mo Brothers, has a nihilistic yet mournful tone, following two murderers, one Japanese and one Indonesian.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two nut cases, one Japanese and the other Indonesian, work out their psychoses on innocent women and despicable men in the aptly named “Killers,” the bludgeon-y sophomore feature from the Mo Brothers, Kimo Stamboel and Timo Tjahjanto.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLERS/23KILLERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLERS/23KILLERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLERS/23KILLERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLERS/23KILLERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1120, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLERS/23KILLERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLERS/23KILLERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23KILLE