’s Roe v. Wade anniversary by pushing through a ban on almost all abortions 20 weeks after fertilization.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/22/abortion-bill-bait-and-switch/', 'snippet': 'House Republican had planned to mark Thursday’s Roe v. Wade anniversary by pushing through a ban on almost all abortions 20 weeks after fertilization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'House Republican had planned to mark Thursday’s 42nd anniversary of the Supreme Court’s 1973 Roe v. Wade decision by pushing through a brazenly unconstitutional measure to prohibit almost all abortions 20 weeks after fertilization. That plan was abruptly abandoned when some female representatives objected to the bill’s callously narrow and politically tone-deaf rape and incest exceptions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Abortion Bill Bait-and-Switch', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roe v Wade (Supreme Court Decision)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-22T22:35:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dorothy J. Samuels', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dorothy', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Samuels', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c131cbed-1aa5-55ae-9d50-ab18e8dd871d', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c131cbed-1aa5-55ae-9d50-ab18e8dd871d'}, {'abstract': 'A list of lenders that provide free copies of FICO scores, three-digit numbers generally ranging from 300 to 850.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2015/01/22/your-money/who-provides-fico-credit-scores.html', 'snippet': 'A list of lenders that provide free copies of FICO score