f4b08b', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/107ac43b-a3c9-5bcf-adbd-3a4df3f4b08b'}, {'abstract': '“Americons,” based on Beau Martin Williams’s personal experience, is a morality tale of high-flying, unscrupulous lenders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/movies/americons-on-the-subprime-mortgage-disaster.html', 'snippet': '“Americons,” based on Beau Martin Williams’s personal experience, is a morality tale of high-flying, unscrupulous lenders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The subprime mortgage disaster is treated as a muddled morality tale of glitzy corruption in Theo Avgerinos’s “Americons.” Mr. Avgerinos’s glossy, overripe take on high-flying, unscrupulous lenders — the wolves of Main Street — deteriorates into a hot mess of montages, trailer-ready one-liners and thudding drama.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23AMERICONS/23AMERICONS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23AMERICONS/23AMERICONS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23AMERICONS/23AMERICONS-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23AMERICONS/23AMERICONS-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 1269, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/23/arts/23AMERICONS/23AMERICONS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum