ed', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/be74c2bf-c32f-53e9-b20a-806b038dca47', 'word_count': 834, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be74c2bf-c32f-53e9-b20a-806b038dca47'}, {'abstract': 'To protect myself, I found a simple way to hide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/25/magazine/track-changes.html', 'snippet': 'To protect myself, I found a simple way to hide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I had just turned 20 the winter I passed as a man. I was backpacking through Europe alone. Others I knew at my study-abroad program in England had found travel companions, but I had decided to venture out by myself, armed with an unlimited train pass and a small amount of cash. My strategy was to sleep on the night trains to save money. It was both a brave and a stupid plan. (Mostly stupid.) It certainly didn’t occur to me in advance that I would need to alter my appearance.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '54', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25lives/25mag-25lives.t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25lives/25mag-25lives.t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 571}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25lives/25mag-25lives.t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25lives/25mag-25lives.t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1554, 'width': 1633, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima