e right to devalue their charity? Shouldn’t he have intervened while the money was being offered? Should he have stayed silent afterward? PATRICK BACHLER, CHICAGO', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25mag-25ethicist.t_CA0-articleLarge.png', 'height': 293, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25mag-25ethicist.t_CA0-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 293}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25mag-25ethicist.t_CA0-jumbo.png', 'height': 500, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25mag-25ethicist.t_CA0-superJumbo.png', 'height': 542, 'width': 1109, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25ethicist-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25ethicist-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/magazine/25ethicist/25ethicist-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Cents, Too Late', 'kicker': 'The Ethicist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Cents, Too Late', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords':