//article/ec6edce9-06b9-5ee6-b123-d57792fc9fb9'}, {'abstract': 'Looking at the depression of 1921.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/25/books/review/the-forgotten-depression-by-james-grant.html', 'snippet': 'Looking at the depression of 1921.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the next big economic disaster hits, Washington will almost certainly choose to do something: cut taxes, increase spending, lower interest rates. There is another option, of course: do nothing. No fiscal or monetary stimulus. Let the fire burn the rot of excess from the system. From the ashes, goes this theory, a healthier, more balanced economy will emerge.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/books/review/25PETHOKOUKHIS/25pethokoukhis-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/25/books/review/25PETHOKOUKHIS/25pethokoukhis-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/books/review/25PETHOKOUKHIS/25pethokoukhis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/books/review/25PETHOKOUKHIS/25pethokoukhis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1530, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/books/review/25PETHOKOUKHIS/25PETHOKOUKHIS-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/25/books/review/25PETHOKOUKHIS/25PETHOKOUKHIS-thumb