amanica and Ben Ratliff discuss ASAP Yams and Kim Fowley, connectors, motivators and talent scouts with keen ears, who died last week.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/23/popcast-asap-yams-and-kim-fowley-departed-tastemakers/', 'snippet': 'Jon Caramanica and Ben Ratliff discuss ASAP Yams and Kim Fowley, connectors, motivators and talent scouts with keen ears, who died last week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The future of pop doesn’t only rest on great singers or musicians or signature-sound producers. It also, sometimes, rests on people who understand opportunity, the movement of taste, fashion, sound, visual style, the way the wind is blowing. They’re not primarily artists or merchants. They’re not necessarily back-room forces — sometimes they are very public — but their roles and strengths remain in flux.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/arts/artsbeat-yams/artsbeat-yams-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/24/arts/artsbeat-yams/artsbeat-yams-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/arts/artsbeat-yams/artsbeat-yams-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/arts/artsbeat-yams/artsbeat-yams-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1344, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/arts/artsbeat-yams/artsbeat-yams-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand