to keep hosting performances.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/25/nyregion/the-tarrytown-music-hall-gets-a-1-5-million-makeover.html', 'snippet': 'With a combination of public and private funds, the oldest operating theater in Westchester County, the Tarrytown Music Hall, positions itself to keep hosting performances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In all likelihood, few of the 80,000 people who attend events at the Tarrytown Music Hall each year noticed that the floor near the north end of the east wall had become slightly spongy underfoot. But Bjorn Olsson, executive director of the hall, had. And he knew why: Poor drainage outside had allowed water to gather, erode the wood-on-stone foundation and seep in under the hall. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/nyregion/25ARTSWE_COMBO/25ARTSWE_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/25/nyregion/25ARTSWE_COMBO/25ARTSWE_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 486}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/nyregion/25ARTSWE_COMBO/25ARTSWE_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 829, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/nyregion/25ARTSWE_COMBO/25ARTSWE_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1659, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/25/nyregion/25ARTSWE_COMBO/25ARTSWE_COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna