earned a spot in the N.H.L. All-Star Game because of the support he received in the league’s fan voting competition, provided largely by Latvia, his home country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/24/sports/hockey/zemgus-girgensons-thrust-into-all-star-game-by-latvian-fans.html', 'snippet': 'Zemgus Girgensons, a center for the Buffalo Sabres, earned a spot in the N.H.L. All-Star Game because of the support he received in the league’s fan voting competition, provided largely by Latvia, his home country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLUMBUS, Ohio — Reporters and photographers at the N.H.L. All-Star Game media day thronged around Zemgus Girgensons, a modest second-year center for one of the league’s worst teams who obliterated a list of hockey superstars in fan voting dominated by his home country, Latvia, where he is a national hero.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/sports/Y-ALLSTAR-1/Y-ALLSTAR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/24/sports/Y-ALLSTAR-1/Y-ALLSTAR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/sports/Y-ALLSTAR-1/Y-ALLSTAR-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/sports/Y-ALLSTAR-1/Y-ALLSTAR-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1344, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/24/sports/Y-ALLSTAR-1/Y-ALLSTAR-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su