 veteran lawmaker on the Navajo reservation, Edmund Yazzie is an integral part of the establishment. He is also the drummer for the metal band Testify.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/us/looking-to-uplift-with-navajo-rez-metal.html', 'snippet': 'As a veteran lawmaker on the Navajo reservation, Edmund Yazzie is an integral part of the establishment. He is also the drummer for the metal band Testify.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FARMINGTON, N.M. — Edmund Yazzie is not the type of guy you expect to see at a heavy metal concert. He is 46, well past the age of youthful angst. As a veteran lawmaker on the Navajo reservation, he is also an integral part of the establishment, known for his starched shirts, polite manner and ardent anti-marijuana stance.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking to Uplift, With Navajo ‘Rez Metal’ ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking to Uplift, With Navajo ‘Rez Metal’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Navajo Indians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Native Americans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yazzie, Edmund', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Mexico', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yazzie, Edmund', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T00:40:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Turkewitz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turkewitz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ec69b78-ff5a-