t://article/aa08c559-9707-5a21-8e24-757f52bf8aae', 'word_count': 730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa08c559-9707-5a21-8e24-757f52bf8aae'}, {'abstract': 'Key provisions include creating a global cadre of emergency health workers, establishing a fund that could be tapped quickly, and support for the development of treatments for emerging infectious diseases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/world/who-members-endorse-resolution-to-improve-response-to-health-emergencies.html', 'snippet': 'Key provisions include creating a global cadre of emergency health workers, establishing a fund that could be tapped quickly, and support for the development of treatments for emerging infectious diseases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the battle to snuff out the Ebola epidemic in West Africa continues, amid hopeful signs of ebbing, fears of an even more deadly and widespread infectious disease’s emerging in the future are motivating efforts to reform global health institutions that faltered in the current outbreak.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'W.H.O. Members Endorse Resolution to Improve Response to Health Emergencies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Criticized on Ebola, U.N. Agency Backs Changes to Improve Its Emergency Response', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fink, Sheri', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T01:56:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheri Fink', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheri', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fink', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fe10107-1dba-5903-a681-d48621ea2ce9', 'word_count': 1347, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fe10107-1dba-5903-a681-d48621ea2ce9'}, {'abstract': 'People are spending more time on messaging apps, which many say allow for multimedia exchanges and commerce in a more intimate setting than older social media sites.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/technology/why-apps-for-messaging-are-trending.html', 'snippet': 'People are spending more time on messaging apps, which many say allow for multimedia exchanges and commerce in a more intimate setting than older social media sites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A team at BuzzFeed, the news and entertainment site, knew it had struck gold when it came across a decades-old photo of Dwayne Johnson, the musclebound wrestler and film star known as The Rock, wearing a fanny pack and dated bluejeans.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/business/26MESSAGING/26MESSAGING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/26/business/26MESSAGING/26MESSAGING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/business/26MESSAGING/26MESSAGING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/business/26MESSAGING/26MESSAGING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1530, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th