icle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/opinion/contrasting-perspectives-on-the-price-of-medicines.html', 'snippet': 'Readers including the Pharmaceutical Research and Manufacturers of America respond to an Op-Ed article.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Contrasting Perspectives on the Price of Medicines', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Contrasting Perspectives on the Price of Medicines', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bach, Peter B', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T08:27:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/d68ff283-7026-5d18-98d5-c025d5a33fce', 'word_count': 558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d68ff283-7026-5d18-98d5-c025d5a33fce'}, {'abstract': 'The taxpayer-financed U.S. Meat Animal Research Center, home to sickening experiments, should be reformed — or shut down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/opinion/farming-science-without-the-conscience.html', 'snippet': 'The taxpayer-financed U.S. Meat Animal Research Center, home to sickening experiments, should be reformed — or shut down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You don’t have to be a vegan to be repulsed by an account in The Times revealing the moral depths to which the federal government — working as a handmaiden to industrial agriculture — has sunk in pursuit of cheaper meat and fatter corporate profits. The article, by Michael Moss, examines the little-kno