ed in many directions by flooded areas.\xa0— The New York Herald, European Edition, Jan. 27, 1915', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/blogs/27iht-oldjan27-suez/27iht-oldjan27-suez-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 539, 'width': 384, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/blogs/27iht-oldjan27-suez/27iht-oldjan27-suez-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 539, 'width': 384, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/blogs/27iht-oldjan27-suez/27iht-oldjan27-suez-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/27/blogs/27iht-oldjan27-suez/27iht-oldjan27-suez-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '1915: Attack on Egypt Imminent', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ottoman Empire', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Suez Canal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T15:03:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27f31c67-dc8c-5f8b-bac0-37f24b6f2c55', 'word_count': 107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27f31c67-d