rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sudoku (Puzzle)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gardner, Martin (1914-2010)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sicherman, George', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T17:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e751f52b-7a17-5327-98b0-f514f21d30d3', 'word_count': 754, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e751f52b-7a17-5327-98b0-f514f21d30d3'}, {'abstract': 'The slick material made a comeback last week on the runways of Calvin Klein, Raf Simons and Pigalle.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/mens-fall-winter-2015-runway-trend-vinyl/', 'snippet': 'The slick material made a comeback last week on the runways of Calvin Klein, Raf Simons and Pigalle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Black vinyl has been associated with fetishists’ attire, the ’70s punk scene, Hype Williams’s music videos of the late ’90s and, more recently, installations by the artist Urs Fischer. And the slick plastic made a comeback in the fall/winter men’s collections last week, giving an alluring, glossy finish to some of the looks. Calvin Klein’s  Italo Zucchelli deployed the fabric — in both gray and black — in a range of familiar men’s silhouettes including baggy trousers, parkas, and shrunken pilot jackets. The model wearing a structured black PVC raincoat in Raf Simons’s recent collection proved that the shiny material can seem approachable when worn as part of a monochromatic look. And for his first appearance on the Paris fashion calendar, Stéphane Ashpool orchestrated a theatrical presentation inside a classic opera house for his street-wear-cum-high-fashion brand Pigalle. Among the nubby knits, track suits, puffers and shearlings was the black vinyl bomber jacket seen above.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/t-magazine/26trend-vinyl-tudela/26trend-vinyl-tudela-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Men’s Fall/Winter 2015 Runways, 