ced the Metropolitan Opera to cancel one of the highlights of its season: Monday night’s planned premiere of a new production of a double bill of Tchaikovsky’s “Iolanta,” starring Anna Netrebko, and Bartok’s “Bluebeard’s Castle.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Met Opera Cancels Premiere; Broadway Shows Canceled', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T20:28:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/41c86fd3-84d5-5b1a-b264-da5105ca57cb', 'word_count': 729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41c86fd3-84d5-5b1a-b264-da5105ca57cb'}, {'abstract': 'Two of the men were posing as official representatives of Russia, but they gave assignments to a third man, federal officials say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/27/nyregion/3-charged-with-working-as-agents-for-russia-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Two of the men were posing as official representatives of Russia, but they gave assignments to a third man, federal officials say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three men would typically agree to meet outside, where one might tell another that he had a book, umbrella or hat to pass on. Then, at the appointed time and place, the secret handoff would occur: a bag, magazine or slip of paper changing hands.', 'pri