and written extensively about architecture, said he was undaunted, having raised more than $80 million in his eight years at the Cincinnati Art Museum. The architecture school’s main campus is in Scottsdale, Ariz., with a campus for summer terms in Spring Green, Wis.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wright Foundation Names Architecture Dean', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wright Foundation Names Architecture Dean', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wright, Frank Lloyd, Foundation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Betsky, Aaron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T20:49:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Pogrebin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce6aa30b-ca3c-5de8-a765-83ef3884f02f', 'word_count': 177, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce6aa30b-ca3c-5de8-a765-83ef3884f02f'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers found that the longer cholesterol remained, elevated the greater the likelihood for cardiovascular disease.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/26/high-cholesterol-takes-its-toll-over-time/', 'snippet': 'Researchers found that the longer cholesterol remained, elevated the greater the likelihood for cardiovascular disease.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Having high cholesterol in your 30s and 40s increases your risk for heart disease, and the longer it stays elevated, the greater the risk, a new study reports.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'High Cholesterol Takes Its Toll Over Time', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cholesterol’s Toll Increases With Time ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cholesterol', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Navar-Boggan, Ann Marie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Circulation (Journal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-26T21:00:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fdf5e74f-adb1-5905-8e4e-16525e280883', 'word_count': 294, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fdf5e74f-adb1-5905-8e4e-16525e280883'}, {'abstract': 'Some say Balti curry, adapted from Pakistan for British tastes, should gain European recognition alongside other iconic foods.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/27/world/europe/shove-over-cornish-pasty-balti-curry-vies-for-a-spot-on-britains-culinary-honor-roll.html', 'snippet': 'Some say Balti curry, adapted from Pakistan for British tastes, should gain European recognition alongside other iconic foods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BIRMINGHAM, England — The year after opening a small restaurant here in 1977, Mohammed Arif spent two weeks in his native Pakistan, where he saw spicy, aromatic curries being cooked and served, sizzling, in the same dish.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/world/27birmingham/27birmingham-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'arti