esday/', 'snippet': 'The Metropolitan Opera will resume performances, as will most Broadway shows, except for “The Lion King” and “Aladdin.” Theaters outside New York were hit harder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The shows are going on. With this week’s snowstorm a bust (at least in most of New York City), Broadway producers and theater owners announced that most plays and musicals would hold their regularly scheduled Tuesday evening performances. Disney’s two Broadway musicals, “The Lion King” and “Aladdin,” have been canceled, a decision producers made on Monday amid grim weather forecasts and the state of emergency declared by government officials. Both shows are offering refunds for Tuesday night’s shows.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/28/arts/27artsbeat-theater/27artsbeat-theater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/28/arts/27artsbeat-theater/27artsbeat-theater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/28/arts/27artsbeat-theater/27artsbeat-theater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/28/arts/27artsbeat-theater/27artsbeat-theater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/28/arts/27artsbeat-theater/27artsbeat-theater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/28/arts/27artsbeat-theater/2