standout look today was a two-piece cobalt ensemble topped with an elaborate floral shrug.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/27/couture-chanel-flowers-spring-summer-2015/', 'snippet': 'A standout look today was a two-piece cobalt ensemble topped with an elaborate floral shrug.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chanel’s couture shows are known for their elaborate sets, and at this morning’s presentation Karl Lagerfeld staged a man-made botanical garden complete with male-model “gardeners” who watered the set to help the flowers “grow.” It wasn’t surprising, then, that many of the looks that followed incorporated fantastical flora. The collection opened with solid tangerine-and-green skirt suits and blossomed into an exquisite bouquet of embroidered dresses and separates. Some of the girls donned lace eye masks and others grunge-style beanies that lent themselves to the laid-back ease of this bold collection. A standout of the day was this two-piece cobalt look topped with a floral bolero and grounded by flat black leather boots.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/t-magazine/27best-chanel-gilchrist/27best-chanel-gilchrist-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/27/t-magazine/27best-chanel-gilchrist/27best-chanel-gilchrist-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/t-magazine/27best-chanel-gilchrist/27best-chanel-gilchrist-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/27/t-magazine/27best-chanel-gilchrist/27best-chanel-gilchrist-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'h