nd forcing the evacuation of 15 people.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/28/illegal-basement-suspected-in-collapse-of-historic-beijing-courtyard/', 'snippet': 'The owner of a courtyard house dug five stories underground for an illegal extension, according to local news reports, setting off a collapse of aboveground structures and forcing the evacuation of 15 people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With land at a premium in Beijing, one enterprising resident attempted to greatly expand his residence, with disastrous results. The owner of a courtyard house in the Chinese capital dug down 60 feet, roughly equivalent to a five-story building, but the illegal excavation was too much for the aboveground structures or adjoining street to support, according to local news reports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Illegal Basement Suspected in Collapse of Beijing Courtyard', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'China National Radio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jiangsu Province (China)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-28T07:16:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/012d8eca-bce9-5b3b-869e-bd9de398de8d', 'word_count': 409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/012d8eca-bce9-5b3b-869e-bd9de398de8d'}, {'abstract': 'Airpocalypse, a sleek, color-coded app, provides weather conditions in Chinese cities, shows air quality measurements and, perhaps most important, “shares your excitement” on clear days and “feels your pain” on smoggy ones.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/28/dystopian-reality-of-chinas-smog-captured-in-airpocalypse-app/', 'snippet': 'Airpocalypse, a sleek, color-coded app, provides weather conditions in Chinese cities, shows air quality measurements and, perhaps most important, “shares your excitement” on clear days and “feels your pain” on smoggy ones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'China’s notorious smog can feel like a physical manifestation of the country’s political repression: suffocating, censored and potentially lethal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/world/28sino-app/28sino-app-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/29/world/28sino-app/28sino-app-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/world/28sino-app/28sino-app-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/world/28sino-app/28sino-app-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/world/28sino-app/28sino-app-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/29/world/28sino-app/28sino-app-thu