omedy, “Fish in the Dark,” has established itself as the blockbuster new play of the spring season even before it begins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry David may be the only person on Broadway who could delight audiences by forgetting his lines. As fans of his HBO hit “Curb Your Enthusiasm” recall, when his character drew a blank while starring in “The Producers” on Broadway, he ad-libbed a hilarious stand-up routine that won the crowd over. That probably won’t happen in his new comedy, “Fish in the Dark,” which has established itself as the blockbuster new play of the spring season even before it begins. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/theater/01david/01david-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/01/theater/01david/01david-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 805}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/theater/01david/01david-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 994, 'width': 741, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/theater/01david/01david-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 994, 'width': 741, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/theater/01david/01david-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/01/theater/01david/01david-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur