https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/28/ok-go-video-and-volcano-journey-make-the-cut-for-drone-film-festival/', 'snippet': 'The festival aims to show what kind of art drones can help make.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Superman flying with a GoPro, an intricately choreographed OK Go music video and a trip inside a volcano will\xa0 all be part of\xa0 the first New York City Drone Film Festival, organizers announced Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'OK Go Video and Volcano Journey Make the Cut for Drone Film Festival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cannes, Schmannes. Hereu2019s a Drone Film Festival.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carr, Steve', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kiernan, Pat', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slavin, Randy Scott', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Directors Guild of America', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Aviation Administration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OK Go (Music Group)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-28T19:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew R. Chow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Chow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4dc3a2e8-a9ec-546e-bd8f-28d5b831dac0', 'word_count': 231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4dc3a2e8-a9ec-546e-bd8f-28d5b831dac0'}, {'abstract': 'Stephen Crowley recently shared images from his Instagram account of President Obama’s trip to India and Saudi Arabia. According to Mr. Crowley, filing live pictures wasn’t easy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/01/28/coverage-in-an-instant-in-the-field-with-crowleygraph/', 'snippet': 'Stephen Crowley recently shared images from his Instagram account of President Obama’s trip to India and Saudi Arabia. According to Mr. Crowley, filing live pictures wasn’t easy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While he is shooting and filing images for print and the web, Stephen Crowley, a photographer for The Times, is also sharing photos on his Instagram account, @crowleygraph.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Coverage in an Instant: In the Field With @crowleygraph', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crowley, Stephen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Instagram Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-28T19:02:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By First Draft', 'person': [{'firstname': 'First', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Draft', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d07e7097-95d6-51b4-8d71-1b17af5f7a51', 'word_count': 115, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d07e7097-95d6-51b4-8d71-1b17af5f7a51'}, {'abstract': 'The Federal Reserve gave its most upbeat economic assessment since the recession, though it did say inflation remains sluggish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/29/business/federal-reserve-rate-decision.html', 'snippet': 'The Federal Reserve gave its most upbeat economic assessment since the recession, though it did say inflation remains sluggish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Federal Reserve kept its options open on Wednesday, signaling that it would not raise short-term interest rates any earlier than June, while leaving unresolved how much longer it might be willing to wait before lifting its benchmark rate from near zero, where the central bank has held it for more than six years.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29fed-web1/29fed-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'head