nytimes.com/2015/01/29/upshot/why-we-cant-blame-a-few-rich-people-for-global-poverty.html', 'snippet': 'The world’s richest 80 people hold as much wealth as the poorest half of the entire planet, but that says more about the poor than the rich.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s a breathtaking statistic: The richest 80 people in the world own as much wealth as the poorest half of the entire planet. It’s the centerpiece of Oxfam’s latest campaign, timed to coincide with the touching down of several of those billionaires in Davos for the World Economic Forum last week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29UP-Wolfers/29UP-Wolfers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29UP-Wolfers/29UP-Wolfers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29UP-Wolfers/29UP-Wolfers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29UP-Wolfers/29UP-Wolfers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1352, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29UP-Wolfers/29UP-Wolfers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/29/business/29UP-Wolfers/29UP-Wolfers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01