 {'abstract': 'Many of the martial soul-pop songs in the Swedish singer Seinabo Sey’s short set at Le Poisson Rouge were inspired by a doomed romance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/29/arts/music/seinabo-sey-unfurls-soul-pop-vocals-at-le-poisson-rouge.html', 'snippet': 'Many of the martial soul-pop songs in the Swedish singer Seinabo Sey’s short set at Le Poisson Rouge were inspired by a doomed romance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A big voice and a loving heart versus a thoughtless, deceitful boyfriend. There should be no question about which deserves to prevail. But without the struggle, countless pop songs would never exist. Seinabo Sey (pronounced SAY-na-bo See) joins the fray with the sadder-but-stronger songs she brought to Le Poisson Rouge on Tuesday night. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/arts/29SEY/29SEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/29/arts/29SEY/29SEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/arts/29SEY/29SEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/arts/29SEY/29SEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1424, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/arts/29SEY/29SEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/29/arts/29SEY/29SEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum