l', 'snippet': 'A photograph from the blizzard posted on Twitter brought the city together in an unexpected way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — As the blizzard raged on Tuesday, Philip L. Hillman, a guest staying at a downtown hotel, peered out his window. He saw that someone had shoveled through the snow accumulating on Boylston Street and revealed the finish line of the Boston Marathon, a rectangle of bare pavement in a sea of white.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Finding Out Who Shoveled the Boston Marathon Finish Line', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-29T03:07:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/467711ae-b912-5627-9106-09d04a33f89d', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/467711ae-b912-5627-9106-09d04a33f89d'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Silver’s fall from grace as speaker of the New York State Assembly played out over a week of secret deliberations and shifting alliances.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/29/nyregion/6-days-that-felled-sheldon-silver-the-speaker-who-ruled-albany-for-decades.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Silver’s fall from grace as speaker of the New York State Assembly played out over a week of secret deliberations and shifting alliances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — After 21 years dominating Albany through his stoicism and unyielding will, Sheldon Silver met his downfall, appropriately enough, after an uncomfortable silence. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/nyregion/jpSILVER1/jpSILVER1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '6 Days That Felled Sheldon Silver, the Speaker Who Ruled Albany 