5/01/29/sheldon-silvers-departure-creates-rare-opportunity-in-albany/', 'snippet': 'The Times editorial board member Eleanor Randolph reflects on Sheldon Silver’s downfall and what it could mean for New York State politics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sheldon Silver, the New York State Assembly speaker, was arrested last week on charges he exploited his office for personal gain. As The Times reported Thursday, an idealistic new wave of Assembly members forced him to resign his post. The Times editorial board member Eleanor Randolph, who has covered Albany and New York politics for nearly 20 years, reflects on what she sees as an opportune moment. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sheldon Silver’s Departure Creates Rare Opportunity in Albany', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Sheldon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-29T19:29:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eleanor Randolph', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eleanor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Randolph', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/64d022f4-d5b5-5ace-8ff0-d88290423938', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64d022f4-d5b5-5ace-8ff0-d88290423938'}, {'abstract': 'The man was flying the drone outside his apartment window when it shot off toward the White House, the friend who owned the device said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/30/us/man-lost-contact-with-drone-before-it-sped-to-white-ho