a-599e1a9ac9d2', 'word_count': 582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/365609bb-f057-5c7c-9eca-599e1a9ac9d2'}, {'abstract': 'The nonprofit agency pays performing artists when their material is heard on Internet and satellite radio services.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/30/business/media/soundexchange-says-it-paid-773-million-in-music-royalties-last-year.html', 'snippet': 'The nonprofit agency pays performing artists when their material is heard on Internet and satellite radio services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As streaming music becomes more popular with consumers, the agency that processes much of the licensing income behind outlets like Pandora and Sirius XM has quickly grown to be one of the music industry’s biggest sources of royalties.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'SoundExchange Says It Paid $773 Million in Music Royalties Last Year', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Broadcast Music Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN SOCIETY OF COMPOSERS, AUTHORS AND PUBLISHERS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SoundExchange', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Royalties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-29T20:18:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1d9687e-a72e-5b54-b72b-19e306e82ff7', 'word_count': 260, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1d9687e-a72e-5b54-b72b-19e306e82ff7'}, {'abstract': '“Fresh Off the Boat,” based on a memoir by the chef Eddie Huang, is the first sitcom about an Asian-American family since Margaret Cho’s short-lived show of the 1990s. Much is riding on it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/01/arts/television/fresh-off-the-boat-is-based-on-the-eddie-huang-memoir.html', 'snippet': '“Fresh Off the Boat,” based on a memoir by the chef Eddie Huang, is the first sitcom about an Asian-American family since Margaret Cho’s short-lived show of the 1990s. Much is riding on it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On “Fresh Off the Boat,” the new ABC family sitcom based on the memoir of the same name by the rowdy, bawdy chef Eddie Huang, the young Eddie is played by Hudson Yang, an amiable 11-year-old with an air of preternatural chill. In the book, Eddie is a bit of a rabble-rouser, but on the show, he’s a fast-learning fish out of water with a gift for comic self-presentation.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/arts/01YANG1/01YANG1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/01/arts/01YANG1/01YANG1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/arts/01YANG1/01YANG1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/arts/01YANG1/01YANG1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/arts/01YANG1/01YANG1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',