ppet': 'Aaron Hernandez is charged with orchestrating the killing of a friend, Odin Lloyd, who was found in a pit at an industrial park near Mr. Hernandez’s home in North Attleboro, Mass.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FALL RIVER, Mass. — Aaron Hernandez wore a dark suit on Thursday, just as his former teammates with the New England Patriots had worn coats and ties earlier in the week. The difference was that they were flying to the Super Bowl and he was walking into his trial on a charge of first-degree murder.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1338, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/sports/30hernandez/30hernandez-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Murder Trial Begins for Former Patriot', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Murder Trial Begins for Former Patriot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hernandez, Aaron (1989- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lloyd, Odin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jenkins, Shayanna', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-29T21:30:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeré Longman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeré', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Longman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3f6f3a7-1b76-5f06-a0bd-d10c8e244039', 'word_count': 1099, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3f6f3a7-1b76-5f06-a0bd-d10c8e244039'}, {'abstract': 'The jewelry designer introduced her nine newest creations, on view here, during Paris Couture Week.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/29/temple-st-clair-carr-jewelry-creatures/', 'snippet': 'The jewelry designer introduced her nine newest creations, on view here, during Paris Couture Week.', 'lead_paragraph': '“What began as an errand to find an ancient coin to make into a necklace for my mother turned into a lifelong passion,” says the New York-based jewelry designer Temple St. Clair Carr. Since she began her line, Temple St. Clair, in 1986, St. Clair Carr’s designs have evolved from mostly gold pieces —\xa0featuring antique amulets and cabochon stones and crafted with historic techniques — into the elaborate fine-jewelry treasures she unveiled today at the Musée des Arts Décoratifs during Paris Couture Week. Called “Mythical Creatures from the Golden Menagerie,” the collection includes nine pieces: Great Horned Owl, Sleeping Fox, Flying Fish, Medusa Moon Jellyfish, Phoenix Chicks, Frog Prince, Sea Dragon, Secret Garden Serpent and Turtles on the Rocks (which, to St. Clair Carr, evoke swimming in country ponds with her family). “This is slow jewelry!” declares St. Clair Carr, who worked on the collection for three years, flying back and forth to Florence as her Italian craftsmen came across “anything particularly beautiful or rare.” The whole set, as seen in the above slideshow, remains on view at Chahan Gallery (by appointment only) until Feb. 6.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Temple St. Clair Carr’s Jeweled Creatures', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'St Clair, Temple', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-29T21:30:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Moroz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moroz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adbeea4d-a55e-56ff-8161-867b8cfec392', 'word_count': 186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adbeea4d-a55e-56ff-8161-867b8cfec392'}, {'abstract': 'The company’s results were squeezed by a number of temporary factors, including a strong dollar that ate into overseas sales.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/30/technology/google-earnings-revenue-squeezed-profit-misses-estimate.html', 'snippet': 'The company’s results were squeezed by a number of temporary factors, including a strong dollar that ate into overseas sales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Everybody knows Google is working on a lot of things besides search. Wall Street wants to know when all those projects will start making a lot of money. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1399, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/business/30google-web/30google-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150