ling disputes, vegan dilemmas and tipping in the age of Groupon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/01/style/social-qs-an-eyeful-next-door.html', 'snippet': 'Questions about spying on neighbors, sibling disputes, vegan dilemmas and tipping in the age of Groupon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The man next door cut down his bamboo trees and exposed his backyard to us (and 20 others in our building). Our young son loves reporting on the doings in the newly visible yard, especially “the man in the pool.” Our neighbor uses his hot tub most mornings, stark naked and in full view of our building. May I speak with him about a compromise? (p.s. He is not European. The gossip is that he is 30, and his parents bought him the house. Yes, I am judging.)', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy