ord_count': 2304, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a38746e2-a041-503e-a247-68769274e2a2'}, {'abstract': 'The rapper and entrepreneur made a $56 million offer for Aspiro, which offers high-fidelity audio streaming through WiMP in Europe and Tidal in the United States', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/business/media/jay-z-bids-on-aspiro-a-swedish-music-streaming-company.html', 'snippet': 'The rapper and entrepreneur made a $56 million offer for Aspiro, which offers high-fidelity audio streaming through WiMP in Europe and Tidal in the United States', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jay Z, the rap star and entrepreneur, has made a $56 million offer for the Swedish company Aspiro, the owner of two digital music services, in a deal that would give him a foothold in the rapidly expanding world of streaming music and put him in competition with major players like Apple and Spotify.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/business/31aspiro-web/31aspiro-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/31/business/31aspiro-web/31aspiro-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/business/31aspiro-web/31aspiro-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/business/31aspiro-web/31aspiro-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/business/31aspiro-web/31aspiro-web-t