k is going public with big dreams. | How Apple beat Microsoft.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/01/30/morning-agenda-crackdown-on-car-title-loans/', 'snippet': 'Car title loans are drawing scrutiny from regulators. | Law firm founds a project to fight “revenge porn.” | Shake Shack is going public with big dreams. | How Apple beat Microsoft.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CRACKDOWN ON LOANS LINKED TO CARS | Car title loans, which allow owners to borrow money against their cars, are under fire, Jessica Silver-Greenberg and Michael Corkery report in DealBook. On Friday, the Federal Trade Commission is expected to announce that it has reached a settlement with two car title lenders, First American Title Lending and Finance Select, over suspicions that they misled borrowers by failing to accurately disclose the terms and costs of the loans, according to people briefed on the action. The agreement will require the companies, both based in Georgia, to overhaul how they advertise and promote their loans, the people said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: Crackdown on Car Title Loans', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-01-30T12:42:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5257ba8e-6122-5704-8cd2-f8b27bf09f31', 'word_count': 2295, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5257ba8e-6122-5704-8cd2-f8b27bf09f31'}, {'abstract': 'Kyle Massey, an assistant news editor, describes life at The Times during a weather emergency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2015/01/30/neither-rain-nor-snow-nor-lack-of-transit/', 'snippet': 'Kyle Massey, an assistant news editor, describes life at The Times during a weather emergency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kyle Massey is an assistant news editor. He has worked at The Times since 1999.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/blogs/nytsnow/nytsnow-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 749, 'width': 505, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/blogs/nytsnow/nytsnow-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 749, 'width': 505, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/blogs/nytsnow/nytsnow-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/29/blogs/nytsnow/nytsnow-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/29/blogs/nytsnow/nytsnow-thumbLarge-v2.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Neither Rain Nor Snow Nor Lack of Transit …', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Massey, Kyle', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value'