Oberlander, a former Sotheby’s employee and founder of the fashionable fine jewelry site Latest Revival, to curate a limited-edition, seven-piece collection to be sold exclusively online. The assortment includes Monique Péan’s diamond pavé ring with a fossilized dinosaur bone; Deborah Pagani’s chandelier earrings with gray and black diamonds; and custom necklaces, earrings and rings by influential brands such as Maiyet, Pamela Love and Completedworks. Each piece also comes with a signed sketch from the designer. “It’s jewelry that can be passed down through generations and will remain as relevant and fresh in the future as it is now,” Oberlander says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/30/t-magazine/30revival-bobb/30revival-bobb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Christie’s Hosts an Online Auction With Some Fresh Names in Fine Jewelry', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Auerbach, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Love, Pamela', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oberlander, Dalia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Latest Revival', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Maiyet (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-30T22:30:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooke Bobb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooke', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bobb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c35a7cb-fc66-5c1a-990b-c179b67a1b14', 'word_count': 169, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c35a7cb-fc66-5c1a-990b-c179b67a1b14'}, {'abstract': 'The man who leapt onto the stage during the Metropolitan Opera’s “Iolanta” to protest Russian actions in Ukraine had done something similar at a Russian violinist’s performance at Harvard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/arts/music/incursion-wasnt-a-first-for-a-protester.html', 'snippet': 'The man who leapt onto the stage during the Metropolitan Opera’s “Iolanta” to protest Russian actions in Ukraine had done