ng while working in restaurants in Charleston, S.C., that she felt the urge to sell some grits in Hopewell, at SweetGrass, her first restaurant as owner and chef.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/01/nyregion/a-review-of-sweetgrass-in-hopewell.html', 'snippet': 'Sarah Gresko, raised in New Jersey, absorbed enough traditional Lowcountry cooking while working in restaurants in Charleston, S.C., that she felt the urge to sell some grits in Hopewell, at SweetGrass, her first restaurant as owner and chef.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who says you have to grow up with grits to love them — or to cook them? Sarah Gresko, raised in New Jersey, absorbed enough traditional Lowcountry cooking while working in restaurants in Charleston, S.C., that she got the itch to sell some grits in Hopewell, at SweetGrass, her first restaurant as owner and chef.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01DINENJ2/01DINENJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01DINENJ2/01DINENJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01DINENJ2/01DINENJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01DINENJ2/01DINENJ2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01DINENJ2/01DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType