ggressive climate change agenda, signing an executive order requiring that all federally funded construction projects take into account the flood risks linked to global warming.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Federal Construction Projects Must Plan for Flood Risks From Climate Change ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Federal Construction Projects Must Plan for Flood Risks From Climate Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Building (Construction)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders and Memorandums', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T00:36:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Coral Davenport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Coral', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Davenport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6ac62c0-2c7b-55b2-b72e-0bf57875bcf6', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6ac62c0-2c7b-55b2-b72e-0bf57875bcf6'}, {'abstract': 'Four months into his new job, Prince Zeid Ra’ad Zeid al-Hussein of Jordan is resisting the efforts of some nations to hold his office to a narrow interpretation of its mandate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/world/un-rights-chief-to-shine-light-on-countries-big-and-small.html', 'snippet': 'Four months into his new job, Prince Zeid Ra’ad Zeid al-Hussein of Jordan is resisting the efforts of some nations to hold his office to a narrow interpretation of its mandate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — IN a 20-year career at the United Nations, Prince Zeid Ra’ad Zeid al-Hussein has had more than a few opportunities to witness the human capacity for cruelty, but nothing seared his memory quite like two scenes from the Balkan wars of the 1990s.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/world/31ZEID/31ZEID-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Rights Chief Says He’ll Shine a Light on Countries Big and Small', 'kicker': 'The Saturday Profile', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Rights Chief Says He’ll Shine a Light on Countries Big and Small', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': "Zeid Ra'ad Zeid Al Hussein", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumming-Bruce, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jordan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T00:37:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Biography', '_id': 'nyt://article/52966894-3618-5c50-853d-bf8fda37f3fc', 'word_count': 1299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52966894-3618-5c50-853d-bf8fda37f3fc'}, {'abstract': 'In her years of conducting soccer clinics, Yael Averbuch writes, one thing has become clear: There is a need for standards of development at various age levels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/30/sports/soccer/holding-soccer-drive-and-devotion-to-a-certain-standard.html', 'snippet': 'In her years of conducting soccer clinics, Yael Averbuch writes, one thing has become clear: There is a need for standards of development at various age levels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s encouraging to witness first-hand how soccer is taking off in the United States. According to a recent survey, youth soccer participation rates increased roughly 300 percent from 1974 to 2014. During my current off-season, I have conducted a number of clinics for some of these youth players. Typically, a club will invite me in for a day, and I work with boys and (mostly) girls on and off the field. Ages and ability levels vary greatly, but I am always astounded and moved by the level of enthusiasm and eagerness I see in the players.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Holding Soccer Drive and Devotion to a Certain Standard', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Averbuch, Yael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T00:40:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Yael Averbuch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Yael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Averbuch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab1ac0f8-0adf-5a07-b030-df4da2295eb8', 'word_count': 755, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab1ac0f8-0adf-5a07-b030-df4da2295eb8'}, {'abstract': 'Two days after a government regulator harshly criticized the company, the two showed signs of moving quickly to cooperate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/business/international/chinese-agency-softens-criticism-of-alibaba-on-sales-of-fake-goods.html', 'snippet': 'Two days after a government regulator harshly criticized the company, the two showed signs of moving quickly to cooperate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was only two days ago that a Chinese government regulator chastised the Alibaba Group, the e-commerce giant, for failing to curb the sale of fake goods on its sites.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chinese Agency Softens Criticism of Alibaba on Sales of Fake Goods ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '