arapova-held-her-own.html', 'snippet': 'While Serena Williams holds a 16-2 advantage in their head-to-head record, in 2004 a 17-year-old Sharapova beat her in two of their first three meetings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MELBOURNE, Australia — As strange as it might seem considering their lifetime head-to-head results, Maria Sharapova had a winning record against Serena Williams until their burgeoning rivalry shifted to Australia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 761, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1522, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/31/sports/31rivalry-01/31rivalry-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Rivalry Was Young, Maria Sharapova Held Her Own', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Australian Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharapova, Maria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Melbourne (Australia)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T00:57:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f81646b9-1d6b-5ee8-afd3-51b41ff701f6', 'word_count': 552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f81646b9-1d6b-5ee8-afd3-51b41ff701f6'}, {'abstract': 'Energy experts said the sudden increase could be explained by various factors, including reports that the Islamic State terrorist group was advancing in an offensive near Iraq’s northern oil fields.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/business/energy-environment/oil-prices-surge-8-after-long-slide-down.html', 'snippet': 'Energy experts said the sudden increase could be explained by various factors, including reports that the Islamic State terrorist group was advancing in an offensive near Iraq’s northern oil fields.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — Oil prices suddenly spiked more than 8 percent on Friday, in the biggest one-day price move for the volatile commodity in nearly three years. But most energy experts said it was too soon to say whether any meaningful shift was underway.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oil Prices Surge 8% After Long Slide Down', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oil Prices Surge 8% After Long Slide Down', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krauss, Clifford', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevron Corporation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Exxon Mobil Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T01:01:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clifford Krauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clifford', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e640e48e-6a62-5742-b448-83281fc379ec', 'word_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e640e48e-6a62-5742-b448-83281fc379ec'}, {'abstract': 'A petition drive for a referendum on using public money to help pay for construction of a soccer stadium in downtown Las Vegas did not gather enough valid signatures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/us/nevada-soccer-stadium-foes-petition-drive-rejected.html', 'snippet': 'A petition drive for a referendum on using public money to help pay for construction of a soccer stadium in downtown Las Vegas did not gather enough valid signatures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A petition drive for a referendum on using public money to help pay for construction of a soccer stadium in downtown Las Vegas did not gather enough valid signatures, Clark County officials said Friday. Opponents of the stadium subsidy submitted more than 9,800 signatures to the county Elections Department. After randomly sampling 500 signatures, elections officials said that only 6,966 were valid, less than the 8,258 they say are required to put the question on the June 2 ballot. Opponents say the state Constitution requires only 2,306 signatures, and have asked a district court judge to order the county to accept fewer signatures. A hearing is scheduled on Feb. 10. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nevada: Soccer Stadium Foes’ Petition Drive Rejected ', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | West', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nevada: Soccer Stadium Foes’ Petition Drive Rejected', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stadiums and Arenas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Referendums', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T01:03:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/bfb43790-f1c5-5706-bf7e-1a365190b509', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfb43790-f1c5-5706-bf7e-1a365190b509'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Wyss, a reporter for The Miami Herald, was surprised to see a picture of himself after his release from Venezuelan detention being used in a campaign for national pride.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/01/31/world/odd-photo-choice-for-venezuela-promotional-effort.html', 'sni