other rank-and-file workers who had gone without contracts for years. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Higher Pay for New York City’s Managers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Higher Pay for City’s Managers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Employees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T02:57:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8c45a37-0480-5ced-a5c8-bfde112e1435', 'word_count': 263, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8c45a37-0480-5ced-a5c8-bfde112e1435'}, {'abstract': 'There’s some pretty chewy stuff in Tim Croce’s Saturday puzzle.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/01/30/give-it-a-go/', 'snippet': 'There’s some pretty chewy stuff in Tim Croce’s Saturday puzzle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY PUZZLE — This is the kind of crossword puzzle that has enough verbalization clues and entries that I could almost write today’s entire blog post in all cap answers. I’ll leave that fun to the commenters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Give It a Go', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-01-31T03:00:25+0000', 'documen