pects’ legs and that the episode was under investigation. In October, Israeli forces fatally shot a 14-year-old Palestinian who also held American citizenship in what the military said were similar circumstances. In December, an Israeli girl, 11, was severely injured when a firebomb hit the car in which she was traveling near her home in a West Bank settlement. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 643, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1285, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/world/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER/PALESTINIAN-FLOATER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 15